  <para style="h">Maake</para>
  <para style="toc1">Anwodelɛnli Maake Edwɛkpa Ne</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maake</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mak</para>
  <para style="mt1">Anwodelɛnli Maake Edwɛkpa Ne</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Ɛhye a le Gyisɛse, Ngoanedievolɛ ne, Nana Nyamenle Ara kotokokye ne anwo adawu nwanwane ne mɔlebɛbo a.<verse eid="MRK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Nana Nyamenle hanle ye wɔ Kapezonli Ayezaya buluku ne anu kɛ, Ɔbazoa Ɔ ra wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo. Na Ɔbalumua yeazoa ɛzoavolɛ titili ko yeamaa yearaziezie ewiade ne yeahendɛ ye maleɛ ne.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Ayezaya zele kɛ, “Zɛhae ɛzoavolɛ ne badɛnla fiemgbole anzɛɛ ɛsɛlɛ resee ne azo, na yeala ye ali kɛ, awie biala ɛziezie ye ahonle nu ɔ nee ye ɛbɛla nu na ɔva ɔhendɛ Awulae maleɛ ne.”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dwɔn sɔnevolɛ ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Zɛhae ɛzoavolɛ ne yemɔ a le Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne. Yemɔ a ɔdɛnlanle fiemgbole ne azo na ɔbɔle ye nolo kɛ ɔwɔ kɛ bɛsɔne awie biala mɔɔ kile kɛ yehwe ɔ nwo yevi ɛtane ɛyɛlɛ nwo a, amaa Nana Nyamenle noko ava ye ɛtane ahyɛ ye. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Menli vi Gyɛlusalɛm nee Dwudiya ngameɛ ngameɛ amuala rale Dwudiya azɛlɛ zo kɛ, bɛba bɛaranlea na bɛadie Dwɔn edwɛkɛ ne, na mɔɔ bɛhanle bɛ ɛtane ne mɔ bɛhilele ye la, ɔzɔnenle bɛ wɔ Azule Dwɔdan ne anu. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Afunlumu nwoma a bɛva bɛnwo ye tɛladeɛ ne mɔɔ ɔwula la amuala a, na nwoma bɛlɛte noko a bɔ zolɛ a; na ye aleɛ a le aabɛ nee ɛhoayelɛ nu wolɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Ye edwɛkpa ne ngilehile ne bie a le kɛ, “Ɔnrɛhyɛ biala awie bie bara mɔɔ ɔle kpole ɔtɛla me bɔkɔɔ a, na ɔlua ye kpole somaa ti, ye mgbɔlaboa ne bɔbɔ mɔɔ ɔwula la memfɛta kɛ menwɔzanyi ye nyɛma ne. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Nzule yɛɛ melɛfa meazɔne bɛ a na yemɔ ɔbava Nana Nyamenle Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne a yeazɔne bɛ a!”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Na kenle ko bie Gyisɛse vi Nazalɛte mɔɔ wɔ Galeli la rale, na Dwɔn zɔnenle ye wɔ Azule Dwɔdan ne anu. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Na mɔɔ Gyisɛse vi azule ne anu vindele la, ɔnwunle kɛ anwuma maanle ne ɛbuke wienyi, na Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne ɛlɛdwu ɔ nwo zo kɛ aabule la. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Na ɛnelɛ bie vi anwuma maanle ne anu zele kɛ, “Wɔmɔ a ɛle me ɛhulolɛ Ralɛ ne a; me anyezɔlɛ Ralɛ a le wɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 1:11" /><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12-13" />Na ndɛndɛ ne ala, Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne hwenle Gyisɛse hɔle ɛsɛlɛ ne azo. Ɔ ngome ɔwɔ ɛkɛ ne too kenle abulanla. Na Abɔnsam zɔle ye nleanle kɛ ɔmaa yeayɛ ɛtane. Na nzinlii, anwumabɔvolɛma noko rale ɛkɛ ne razonlenle ye.<verse eid="MRK 1:12-13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Mɔɔ Belemgbunli Hɛlɔdo maanle bɛhyele Dwɔn la, yeangyɛ biala Gyisɛse hɔle Galeli kɛ ɔkaha Nyamenle Edwɛkpa ne.<verse eid="MRK 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Ɔse: “Akee mekɛ ne ɛdwu. Nana Nyamenle Ye Belemgbunli maanle ne ɛbikye! Awie biala ɛhwe ɔ nwo ɛvi ɛtaneyɛlɛ nu, na ɔlie Edwɛkpa ne ɔli na ɔnlea zo ɔbɔ ye ɛbɛla noko.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse ɛkpa ye ɛdoavolɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Kenle ko bie mɔɔ Gyisɛse lua ɛnweazo wɔ Galeli nyevile ne anloa la, ɔnwunle Saemɔn ɔ nee ɔ diema Andelu kɛ bɛlɛ avonle bɛlɛkye fɛlɛ, ɔluakɛ, bɛle adwɛnekɔvolɛma.<verse eid="MRK 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Gyisɛse deanle nu vɛlɛle bɛ na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛrɛla, bɛradoa me! Na mebayɛ bɛ menli mɔɔ bɛto avonle bɛkye menli ngɛla a!” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Ɛkɛ ne ala bɛgyakyile bɛ avonle ne na bɛdoale ye bɛ nee ye hɔle.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Bɛhɔle bɛ nyunlu ekyii la, ɔnwunle Zɛbɛdi amra nwiɔ ne, Gyemise nee Dwɔn, kɛ bɛde ɛlɛne nu na bɛlɛsa bɛ avonle ne mɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Ɔvɛlɛle bɛdabɛ noko, na ndɛndɛ ne ala bɛgyakyile bɛ ze Zɛbɛdi nee ɛkpavoma ne mɔ wɔ ɛlɛne ne anu na bɛdoale ye bɛ nee ye hɔle.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Gyisɛse nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ɛhye mɔ akee hɔdwule Kapɛnayɛm sua ne azo; ye Folɛ nwonlomɔ ne bɛhɔle Dwuuma ayiasua ne anu na ɔhanle Edwɛkpa ne. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Ye ngilehile ne yɛle menli mɔɔ bɛwɔ asɔne sua ne anu la amuala azibɛnwo, ɔluakɛ, ɔdendɛle tumi nu na yeanyɛ kɛ menli mɔɔ fa awie mɔ edwɛkɛ kile bɛ deɛ nu la, bɔbɔ kɛmɔ kɛlɛhɛlɛvolɛma ne mɔ ye ye la.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Menli ngakyile ɛde kpɔkɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Nrenyia bie mɔɔ ɛnee bozonle ɛva ye la noko wɔ ɛkɛ ne bie, na ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔteɛdea nu kɛ, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Gyisɛse, Nazalɛtenli, duzu ati a ɛlɛgyegye yɛ zɛhae a, wɔra kɛ ɛba wɔarazɛkye yɛ anzɛɛ? Nea, meze wɔ sonla holɛ. Wɔmɔ a ɛle Nana Nyamenle Ara nwuanzanwuanza ne a!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Gyisɛse deanle sunsum ɛtane ne nu kɛ ɔyɛ koonwu ɔvi nrenyia ne nu ɔvinde. <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Na amgba noko sunsum ɛtane ne kponlenle ɔ bo ɔpɛle nrenyia ne ɔdole ye aze na ɔvi ye nu ɔvindele ɔhɔle. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Ɛhye yɛle menli ne mɔ azibɛnwo na bɛzele bɛ nwo ngoko ngoko kɛ, “Duzu ɛzonlenlɛ fofolɛ a le ɛhye? Duzu ati a awozonle bɔbɔ tie ye na bɛdi ye edwɛkɛ zo a?”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Na ndɛndɛ ne ala ye nwanwane ninyɛne ne mɔɔ yeye la anwo adawu zandele Galeli maanle ne anu amuala.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29-30" />Na bɛvile Ayiasua ne anu la, ɔ nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ hɔle Saemɔn nee Andelu sua nu, na bɛhɔdole kɛ ebunlu ɛhye Saemɔn azebɛla ɛsesebɛ ɛsesebɛ na ɔlua zo ɔla ɛkpa nu, na bɛhanle bɛhilele Gyisɛse. <verse eid="MRK 1:29-30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Gyisɛse hɔle ye ɛkpa ne anwo ɔhɔzɔle ɔ sa kɛ ɔboa ye yeamaa yeadɛnla aze, na ɛkɛ ne ala ebunlu ne vi ye nu dule, na ɔdwazole na ɔdonle debie ɔmaanle bɛ!<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32-33" />Mɔɔ ɔkadwu sɛnzɛndɔleɛ la ɛnee wuliravolɛma nee menli mɔɔ awozonle ɛva bɛ la ɛyi aako ne anu tɛkɛɛ, kɛ bɛba bɛamaa yeayɛ bɛ ayile; na menli dɔɔnwo mɔɔ bɛvi Kapɛnayɛm sua ne azo amuala la rayiale ɛkɛ ne kɛ bɛbanlea bie. <verse eid="MRK 1:32-33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Yemɔti Gyisɛse yɛle wuliravolɛma dɔɔnwo ne ala ayile na eza ɔdule awozonle ɔvile dɔɔnwo ne ala anu wɔ zɔhane nɔsolɛ ne. Na emomu, yeammaa awozonle ne mɔ adenle yeammaa bɛandendɛ, ɔluakɛ, ɛnee bɛze ye sonla holɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Aleɛ hyenle la, ɔdwazole nwonlomɔ mangyee ne ala ɔhɔle fiemgbole ne azo kɛ ɔ ngomekye ɔkazɛlɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36-37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36-37" />Nzinlii, Saemɔn nee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛha la hɔle kɛ bɛkakpondɛ ye. Na mɔɔ bɛnwunle ye la, bɛzele ye kɛ, “Awie biala ɛlɛbiza ɛ bo zo.”<verse eid="MRK 1:36-37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Na ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, “Ɔwɔ kɛ yɛkɔ azua azua mɔɔ ɛha la azo na mekɔka edwɛkpa ne mekile bɛ wɔ ɛkɛ ne noko, ɔluakɛ, ɔlua ɛhye ati a membale aleɛabo a.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Yemɔti ɔhɔle Galeli maanzinli ne anu amuala, na ɔhɔhanle edwɛkpa ne wɔ bɛ ayiasua ne mɔ anu, na ɔvale tumi ɔdule dɔɔnwo ne ala bɛ awozonle ɔvile bɛ nu. <verse eid="MRK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Kenle ko, kokobɛvolɛ bie noko rahotole ɔ nyunlu na ɔbodole ɔzɛlɛle ye kɛ, “Saa ɔyɛ wɔ ɛhulolɛ ɛdeɛ a, ɛbahola wɔayɛ me ayile.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Na Gyisɛse anwunvɔnezelɛ nu ala zɔle ye na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Ɔyɛ me ɛhulolɛ! Te kpɔkɛ!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Na ɛkɛ ne ala kokobɛ ne vi ɔ nwo dule bɔkɔɔ, na nrenyia ne anwo zale!<verse eid="MRK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43-44" />Gyisɛse akee bɔle ye kɔkɔ ɛsesebɛ ɛsesebɛ kɛ, “Mmaka ɛkile awie biala wɔ adenle nu. Na kɔ kɔva ɛ nwo kile Dwuuma azɛlɛvolɛ ne mɔ maa bɛbɔ wɔ azu kɛmɔ Mosisi mɛla ne se la, amaa awie biala ali nwolɛ daselɛ kɛ amgba ɛ nwo ɛza bɔkɔɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 1:43-44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Noko akee nrenyia ne lua adenle nu ɔkɔ la yeangola edwɛkɛ ne fa sie; ɔbɔle ye nolo wɔ maanle ti nee maanle bo kɛ ɔ nwo ɛza. Ɛhye ati ɛnee akee Gyisɛse ɛngola sua zo kɔ wɔ wienyi nu, na ɔde ahanle ahanle wɔ ɛsɛlɛ reserese ne mɔ azo. Na menli dɔɔnwo ne ala vi ɛleka gyɛne gyɛne rale ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Mɔɔ mekɛ guale nu bie la, ɔziale ɔrale Kapɛnayɛm bieko, na bɛdele ye nganeɛ ndɛndɛ ne ala wɔ sua ne azo amuala. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Yeangyɛ biala, nyɛvolɛ yile aako ne mɔɔ ɔwɔ nuhua la fetee zɛhae mɔɔ adenle biala bɔbɔ ɛnla ɛkɛ ne ɛmmaa sonla ko bɔbɔ wɔ alie nwo nehane a. Na ɔhanle Edwɛkpa ne ɔhilele bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Na mgbavolɛ nna mɔɔ bɛzo nrenyia bie mɔɔ ɛdwudwe wɔ ahomanga nu la noko rale ɛkɛ ne bie. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Na ɔlua menli dɔɔnwo ne ati bɛangola ɛlɛka mɔɔ Gyisɛse wɔ la dwu, ɛhye ati bɛkpale sua ne azo ezumule ne foa ko na bɛdwulale ye nee ɛkpa ne amuala aze wɔ sua ne anu.<verse eid="MRK 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Na mɔɔ Gyisɛse nwunle bɛ diedi kpole ne wɔ ye nu kɛ ɔbahola yeaboa bɛ la, ɔzele wuliravolɛ ne kɛ, “Me ra, bɛva wɔ ɛtane amuala bɛhye wɔ!”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Na Dwuuma asɔne mgbanyima mɔɔ wɔ ɛkɛ ne na bɛdele la zele bɛ nwo kɛ: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Ɛnee nwane bɔbɔ a ɛlɛka ɛhye a? Munzule edwɛkɛ a le ɛhye! Anzɛɛ ɔdwenle kɛ ɔle Nyamenle ɔ? Ɔluakɛ, Nyamenle angomekye ala a kola fa ɛtane kyɛ a.”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse ndɛndɛ ne ala nwunle mɔɔ wɔ bɛ adwenle nu la, ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Duzu ati a ɛhye fale bɛ nwo a? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9-11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9-11" />Mame, Ngoanedievolɛ ne, melɛ tumi kɛ mefa ɛtane mekyɛ wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo. Na emomu mebiza bɛ kɛ, boni yɛɛ ye hanle ɛnye se a, kɛ ɛkɛze wuliravolɛ ne kɛ, bɛva wɔ ɛtane bɛhyɛ wɔ anzɛɛ dwazo fa wɔ ɛkpa na tia? Na kɛ ɔkɛyɛ na bɛanwu kɛ Ngoanedievolɛ ne lɛ tumi fa ɛtane kyɛ la,” akee mese wɔmɔ wuliravolɛ ɛhye kɛ, “Dwazo maa wɔ ɛkpa ne zo na kɔ sua nu, ɔluakɛ ɛ nwo ɛza!”<verse eid="MRK 2:9-11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Na amgba noko ɔdwazole foa, na ɔmaanle ye ɛkpa ne zo ɛkɛ ne ala na ɔvale menli dɔɔnwo ne avinli ɔdiale kilikili ɔhɔle sua nu! Ɛhye zinle bɛ nwo totohyia, yemɔti bɛhanvole Awulae Nana Nyamenle na bɛzele kɛ, “Yɛtɛnwunle debie mɔɔ le kɛ ɛhye la bie ɛlɛ!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Na Gyisɛse vindele hɔle ɛnweazo lɔ bieko, na ɔhanle edwɛkpa ne ɔhilele menli dɔɔnwo ne mɔɔ eza rabɔle yiale ye la. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Na mɔɔ ɔlua ɛnwea ne azo ɔlɛkɔ la, ɔnwunle Livae, mɔɔ ɔ ze a le Alefiyɛse la kɛ ɔde ye adwule ɛkponle nwo. Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Bɛla maa yɛhɔ. Bayɛ me ɛdoavolɛ.” Na amgba noko, Livae nyianle ahomeka na ɔdoale Gyisɛse ɔ nee ye hɔle.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Kenle ko ne ye nɔsolɛ ne, Livae dole ɛkponle, na ɔdole ɔ sa ɔvɛlɛle ɔ gɔnwo mɔ adwuledievolɛma nee ɛtanevolɛma dɔɔnwo wɔ ɔ bo amaa bɛahola bɛayia Gyisɛse nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Na mɔɔ Dwuuma asɔne mgbanyima ne mɔ nee kɛlɛhɛvolɛma ne mɔ mɔɔ doale Gyisɛse hɔle ɛkɛ ne bie la nwunle kɛ ɔ nee zɛhae menli ne mɔ ɛlɛto ɛsalɛ la, bɛbizale ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Duzu ati a ɔ nee ɛtanevolɛma to ɛsalɛ ko a?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Na mɔɔ Gyisɛse dele mɔɔ bɛlɛka la ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛnwu sonla mɔɔ ɔte kpɔkɛ na ɔlɛkɔ ayileyɛlɛ la ɔ? Tɛ tenlenema ati a membale a; na ɛtanevolɛma ati ɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyamenle ra ne mɔɔ vi anwuma maanle nu la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Dwɔn ɛdoavolɛma ne nee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne ɔyɛ a kye ɛhɔne. Ɛhye ati bɛrabizale Gyisɛse kɛ, “Duzu ati a yɛmɛ yɛkye ɛhɔne na wɔ ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ɛngye bie a?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Na Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Asoo menli mɔɔ wɔ atɔfolɛ bo la bahola ahye ɛhɔne ɔ? Ɔwɔ kɛ bɛdi nyane wɔ melɛ ala mɔɔ atɔfolɛ kunli ne nee bɛ wɔ ɛkɛ la ɔ? <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Na emomu, mekɛ bie bara mɔɔ bɛbaye atɔfolɛ nrenyia ne bɛavi ɛkɛ a, na zɔhane mekɛ ne a bɛdabɛ noko bɛbali bɛ nyane deɛ ne a. <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Yɛɛ bɛnva ɛdanlɛ fofolɛ noko bɛnda mɔɔ ɛvo la anu! Ɛyɛ ɛhye a akee ɔmaa tokule ne tukue haanwu zɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Zɔhane ala noko yɛɛ bɛnva nza fofolɛ bɛngua nwoma toba dɛba nu a. Ɛyɛ zɛhae a nwoma toba ne kpuke na nza ne yɛ mgbane. Ɛhye ati a nza fofolɛ biala, nwoma toba fofolɛ nu a bɛgua ye la.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Melɛ bie, wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne anu ɛnee Gyisɛse nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ lua ɛya bie anu. Na ɛnee ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ɛlɛbubu atoko adile, na eza bɛlɛdi ye ma ne bie noko.<verse eid="MRK 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Dwuuma asɔne mgbanyima ne mɔ bie zele Gyisɛse kɛ, “Ɔnle kɛ bɛyɛ zɔhane! Ɔluakɛ, ɔtia yɛ mɛla kɛ bɛkɛyɛ gyima bɛkɛbu aleɛ wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne.”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25-26" />Na Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛtɛkengale mɔɔ Belemgbunli Devidi yɛle la anzɛɛ? Mekɛ bie mɔɔ ɛhɔne hunle ɔdaye nee ɔ nwo amra la, yeangɔ Awulae Nyamenle asɔne sua ne anu, wɔ Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli Abayata mekɛ zo yeangɔnli kpanwo nwuanzanwuanza ne mɔɔ azelɛvolɛ ne mɔ ala a bɛmaa bɛ adenle bɛmaa bɛdi la ɔ? Na ɛhye noko ɛnee tia mɛla ne.” <verse eid="MRK 2:25-26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Akee ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne wɔ ɛkɛ maa sonla boɛyɛlɛ, na tɛ sonla a wɔ ɛkɛ ne maa Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne a. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Na Mame, Ngoanedievolɛ ne a melɛ tumi bɔbɔ kɛ ɔwɔ kɛ, mekile deɛ mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ sonla yɛ ye wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne la a.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse wɔ Kapɛnayɛm la, ɔhɔle ayiasua ne anu bieko, na ɔ nye bɔle nrenyia bie mɔɔ asa ɛdwe la anwo zo.<verse eid="MRK 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Kɛmɔ melɛ zɔhane ɛnee le Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle la ati, Gyisɛse ye kpɔvolɛma ne mɔ nleanle ye koonwu kpalɛ kɛ saa ɔkɛyɛ ye ayile wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne a ɛnee bɛava ɔ nwo adwenle na bɛahye ye.<verse eid="MRK 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Na Gyisɛse maanle nrenyia ne dwazole na ɔrale ɔragyinlanle menli ne mɔ anyunlu wɔ asɔne sua ne anu. <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Na Gyisɛse dole ɔ nye ɔ nzi na ɔbizale ye kpɔvolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Ɔfa mɛla nu kɛ ɛkɛyɛ kpalɛ wɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne, anzɛɛ kɛ ɛkɛyɛ ɛtane wɔ nu ɔ? Kɛ ɛkɛlie menli ngoane anzɛɛ kɛ ɛkɛhu bɛ ɔ?” Na bɛ nuhua biala ambua ye bie. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Akee ɔvale ɛya ɔnleanle bɛ muala ɔyiale, ɔluakɛ ɛnee ye ɛbolɛ ɛlɛte wɔ bɛ ahonle ɛsesebɛ ne mɔ ati. Na akee ɔzele nrenyia ne kɛ, “Tenrɛ ɛ sa ne anu!” Nrenyia ne noko yɛle zɔhane, na ɛkɛ ne ala ɔ sa ne yɛle kɛ ye dɛba ne ala la.<verse eid="MRK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Na ndɛndɛ ne ala Falasiima ne vindele hɔle hɔyiale Hɛlɔdiama ne na bɛvale akpame, kɛ ɔkɛyɛ na bɛ sa aha Gyisɛse bɛahu ye la. <verse eid="MRK 3:6" /><verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7-8" />Wɔ mekɛ ɛhye anu, Gyisɛse nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ noko hwenle bɛ nwo hɔle ɛnweazo lɔ; na menli dɔɔnwo mɔɔ vi Galeli, Dwudiya, Gyɛlusalɛm, Ayedumia, nee Azule Dwɔdan ne anzi moamoa lɔ nee Taya nee Saedɛn noko la doale ye. Ɔluakɛ ye nwanwane ninyɛne mɔɔ ɛnee ɔlɛyɛ la anwo adawu ɛdɛlɛ ɛdwu moa na bɛkulo kɛ bɛnwu ɔdaye mumua ne bɛ nye zo. <verse eid="MRK 3:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Na ɔzele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ bɛkpondɛ ɛlɛne bɛmaa ye bɛmaa ɔgyinla nu amaa menli dɔɔnwo ne ambantietia ɔ nwo zo. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Ɔluakɛ, ɛnee yemaa wuliravolɛma dɔɔnwo ne ala anwo ɛza kenle ko zɔhane, na ɔlua zo, bɛ dɔɔnwo ne ala noko ɛrabɔ ɛyia ye na bɛkulo kɛ bɛka ye.<verse eid="MRK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Na awie biala mɔɔ bozonle ɛva ye la nwu ye ala a ɛnee yepɛ yefi na ɔlɛteɛdea nu kɛ, “Wɔmɔ a ɛle Nana Nyamenle Ara ne a!” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Noko yemɔ ɔbɔle bɛ kɔkɔ ɛsesebɛ ɛsesebɛ ne ala kɛ bɛmmada ye ali bɛkile awie biala.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛvɛlɛle gyimayɛvoma dɔɔnwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Nzinlii ɔhɔle awoka ne mɔ azo na ɔvɛlɛle bie mɔ mɔɔ ɔkpondɛ bɛ la, na ɔmaanle bɛrale ɔ nwo ɛke ne. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14-15" />Na akee ɔyɛle bɛ nuhua bulu nee nwiɔ, mɔɔ ɔdonle bɛ duma ɛdoavolɛma la, kɛ bɛraboka ɔ nwo, na ɔzoa bɛ ɔmaa bɛhɔha edwɛkpa ne, na bɛva ye tumi bɛdu awozonle. <verse eid="MRK 3:14-15" /><verse number="16-19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16-19" />Bulu nee nwiɔ ne mɔɔ ɔyele bɛ la anluma a le ɛhye mɔ: Saemɔn, mɔɔ ɔdonle ye duma Pita la, Gyemise nee Dwɔn, mɔɔ bɛ ze a le Zɛbɛdi, na Gyisɛse yemɔ ɔvɛlɛle bɛ “Ezule ɛhululɛ amra la,” Andelu, Felepe, Baatɔlomiyu, Mateyu, Tɔmase, Gyemise, mɔɔ ɔ ze a le Alefiyɛse la, Tadease, Saemɔn, maanlebulɛ eku ne mɔ ko anu sonla mɔɔ ɛnee ɔlɛbɔ mɔdenle kɛ bɛkɛdu Wulome Arane ne bɛkɛgua la, ɔ nee Dwudase Yesekaleɔto, mɔɔ nzinlii ɔyele ye ɔmaanle la.<verse eid="MRK 3:16-19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Na ɔziale ɔhɔle sua nu la menli dɔɔnwo ne bɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛyia ɛkɛ ne bieko, na yeangyɛ biala nyɛvolɛ yile ɛkɛ ne fetee zɛhae, mɔɔ ɔlua zo yeannyia adenle yeamkpula ɔ sa bɔbɔ a. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Na mɔɔ ɔ gɔnwo mɔ dele ɛhye la, bɛrale kɛ bɛbɔ mɔdenle bɛahye ye bɛ nee ye ahɔ sua nu. Bɛzele kɛ, “Kabezɛ ɔlɛbɔ ɛlane.”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛtane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Na Dwuuma ahilehilevolɛ mɔɔ ka Nyamedwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ ɛnee vi Gyɛlusalɛm ɛra ɛkɛ ne la zele kɛ, “Yɛ amaneɛ a le kɛ Abɔnsam ɛwolo ye nu. Yemɔti a awozonle bɔbɔ tie ye la.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Gyisɛse vɛlɛle menli ɛhye mɔ maanle bɛrale ɔ nwo ɛkɛ, na ɔbule bɛ ɛrɛlɛ kɛ, “Kɛ Abɔnsam si kola tu Abɔnsam ɛ? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Belemgbunli maanle mɔɔ kpakye ye nu nwiɔ tia ɔ nwo la golo gua. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Yɛɛ aako noko mɔɔ foa ko kɛho kɛtia foa ko la ɔdaye ɔbɔ. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Na saa Abɔnsam dwazo ko tia ɔ nwo a kɛ ɔkɛzi ɔkɛyɛ na yeanyia debie ɛ? Saa ɔba ye zɔ a ɔnrɛli agyinla. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Awie biala ɛngola ɛngɔ sonla anwosesebɛvolɛ sua nu ɛngɔnzɛkye ye ninyɛne, kyesɛ ɔdumua ɔkyekye ahenle ne kolaa na yeahola yeawua ye ninyɛne ne.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />“Nɔhalɛ nu mese bɛ kɛ, saa bɛkɛva ɛtane biala bɛkɛhyɛ dasanli bɔbɔ a, ɛnee tɛ mɔɔ bɛyɛ bɛtia Sunsum, Nwuanzanwuanza ne la ɔ! <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Awie biala mɔɔ kɛdendɛ ɛtane kɛtia Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne la, yemɔ bɛnrɛva ye ɛtane bɛnrɛhyɛ ye ɛlɛ, ɔluakɛ, ɔle ɛtane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ a.”<verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Ɔhanle ɛhye ɔhilele bɛ, ɔboalekɛ ɛnee bɛlɛkeha kɛ, ɔfa Abɔnsam tumi a ɔyɛ ye nwanwanendeɛ ne mɔ a, na tɛ Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne tumi ne ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31-32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31-32" />Na ɔ nli nee ɔ mediema ne mɔ rale ɛleka mɔɔ ɛnee ɔlɛkile debie mɔɔ menli dɔɔnwo ɛyi ɛkɛ ne la, na bɛzoanle kɛ, bɛhɔvɛlɛ ye bɛmaa ɔvinde alie nwo na bɛ nee ye ɛdendɛ. Menli dɔɔnwo ne noko dɛnlanle ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne, na bɛzele ye kɛ, “Nea, ɛ nli nee ɛ mediema mrenyia ne mɔ kulo kɛ bɛnwu wɔ wɔ alie nwo nehane.”<verse eid="MRK 3:31-32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, “Ɔmɔ a le nwane? Yɛɛ me mediema ne mɔ noko a le nwane mɔ?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Akee ɔdole ɔ nye ɔnleanle menli mɔɔ ɛbɔ ɛyia ye la, na ɔzele kɛ, “Me nli nee me mediema mrenyia ne mɔ a le ɛhye mɔ! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Awie biala mɔɔ yɛ Nana Nyamenle ɛhulolɛdeɛ la yemɔ a le me diema nrenyia, nee me diema raalɛ nee me nli a.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse hilehilele menli ne debie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Ɔziale ɔrale ɛnwea ne azo kɛ ɔbahilehile bieko. Na menli dɔɔnwo bie eza dule twi rayiale ɛkɛ ne. Ɛhye ati ɔvole ɛlɛne nu na ɔdɛnlanle aze na akee ɔdendɛle ɔhilele bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Na ɔbule mrɛlɛ dɔɔnwo ɔvale ɔhilehilele bɛ ɔzele kɛ:<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Bɛdie! Ɛyazonlɛnli bie hɔle kɛ ɔkagua ye awule wɔ ye ɛya nu. Na mɔɔ ɔgua la, <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />bie mɔ guale adehanle ne, na nloma rale rasusole. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5-6" />Bie mɔ noko guale awozaka nu. Bɛfifile ndɛndɛ ɛdeɛ, noko akee kɛmɔ ɛnwea ne le ekyi la ati ewia ne yelale bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Bie mɔ noko guale mbowule nu. Na mbowule ne wowɔle bɛ ɔlua zo bɛangola ma so. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Na ma ne mɔ bie guale azɛlɛ kpalɛ zo na bɛzole ma dɔɔnwo: bie deɛ mɔnwo abulasa, bie deɛ mɔnwo abulasia; yɛɛ bie deɛ mɔnwo ɛya. <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Akee ɔzele bɛ kɛ, ‘Mɔɔ lɛ ɛnzolɛ tie la, bɛmaa ɔdie!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Nzinlii mɔɔ ɔhale ɔ ngome nee Bulu Nee Nwiɔ ne nee ye ɛdoavolɛma mɔɔ ɛha la bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Na wɔ adawu ne abo a le duzu?”<verse eid="MRK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11-12" />Na ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, “Bɛmɛ bɛlɛ adenle kɛ bɛkɛnwu Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anwo nɔhalɛ ne mɔɔ bɛye bɛvea bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛnle Belemgbunli maanle ne anu la bie. Kɛmɔ kapezonli Ayezaya hanle la: ‘Bɛkɛde na eza bɛkɛnwu ye ɛdeɛ, noko akee bɛnrɛde ɔ bo anzɛɛ bɛnrɛra Awulae Nyamenle ɛkɛ, anzɛɛ bɛnrɛva bɛ ɛtane bɛnrɛhyɛ bɛ.’ <verse eid="MRK 4:11-12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Na saa bɛnde ɛrɛlɛ ɛhye bɔbɔ abo a, ɛnee akee ɛrɛlɛ ne boni a bɛbade ɔ bo a?<verse eid="MRK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />“Ɛyasovonli ne mɔɔ menganle ye edwɛkɛ la yemɔ a le awie biala mɔɔ ɔka Awulae Nyamenle Edwɛkpa ne ɔkile awie mɔ, na ɔbɔ mɔdenle kɛ ɔkɛlua ma kpalɛ wɔ bɛ ɛbɛlabɔlɛ nu la. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Adehanle ketekete ne mɔɔ ma ne mɔ bie guale la, gyi ɛkɛ maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛ ahonle ne mɔ yɛ se la, ɔluakɛ bɛte Edwɛkpa ne ala a ɛnee Abɔnsam ɛrabɛlɛbɛla bɛ ndɛndɛ ne ala ɛmaa bɛ rɛle ɛvi ye bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16-17" />Awozaka ɛnwea ne kile bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛ ahonle ne mɔ yɛse, na bɛfa fɛlɛko bɛtie Edwɛkpa ne, na ɔluakɛ, bɛle kɛ mbaka mralɛ mɔɔ bɛlua bɛ wɔ zɛhae ɛnwea nu la ati, bɛ ndinli ne mɔ ɛngɔ moa la; kɛ bɛtwi bɛ nyunlu ekyi la ɛnee bɛhwe bɛ nzi.<verse eid="MRK 4:16-17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />“Mbowule azɛlɛ ne gyi ɛkɛ maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdie Edwɛkpa ne bɛsie bɛ ahonle nu, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />noko akee ɔlua ewiade ɛhye anu fɛlɛkolilɛ, nee ye anyiabɛnwo ɛhulolɛ, nee menli nyunlu ngɔzo ti, Edwɛkpa ne ɛnnyia adenle ɛmboa bɛ ahonle ne mɔ anu la.<verse eid="MRK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />“Azɛlɛ kpalɛ ne gyi ɛkɛ maa bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛfa Edwɛkpa ne bɛsie bɛ ahonle nu nɔhalɛ nu na bɛso nwolɛ ma mɔnwo mɔnwo bɛmaa Nyamenle, bie abulasa, bie abulasia, anzɛɛ ɛya bɔbɔ la.” <verse eid="MRK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Akee ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Asoo awie sɔ kɛnlaneɛ a, ɔfa ɛlɛka ɔbutu zo ɔmaa ɔsi wienyi ne adenle ɔ? Ɛhye yemɔ Kyɛkyɛ! Bɛfa kɛnlaneɛ bɛsie debie zo wɔ anwuma amaa yeada na eza nwolɛ ara nvasoɛ.<verse eid="MRK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />“Debie biala mɔɔ wɔ fealera nu ɛnɛ la bala ali kenle bie. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Saa bɛlɛ ɛnzolɛ a ɛnee bɛdie. <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Na bɛva mɔɔ bɛte noko la bɛbɔ bɛ ɛbɛla. Bɛyɛ ɛhye dɔɔnwo dɔɔnwo a yɛɛ bɛkɛde mɔɔ meka mekile bɛ la abo a. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Mɔɔ lɛ bie la bɛbazɔ ye zo; na mɔɔ ɛnlɛ bie la, bɛbaza ye bɛalie ye deɛ ekyi ne bɔbɔ mɔɔ ɔlɛ la bɛavi ɔ sa nu.<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />“Eza ɔbule Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anwo ɛrɛlɛ bieko ɔzele kɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:26">“Ɛyasovonli bie guale ma wɔ ye ɛya nu, <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />na ɔhɔle. Nzinlii, ma ne nyinle mɔɔ ɛnee ɔnze nwolɛ edwɛkɛ biala a. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Ɔluakɛ azɛlɛ ne azo ɛva ne a maanle ma ne mɔ fifile a. Alumua ne nya vindele, nzinlii akee ɔbɔle ndotolo, ma noko rale; na amozi ye ɔbolole sɔɔnwo zɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Akee ɛyasovonli ne vale ye nrɛlande na ɔrabule.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Na Gyisɛse bizale bɛ kɛ, “Kɛ menzi menga Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anwo edwɛkɛ ɛ? Duzu ɛrɛlɛ anzɛɛ adawu a menva mendo nwo a? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31-32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31-32" />Ɔle kɛ dubinli ma la! Yemɔ a le ma ne mɔ anu nretee kpalɛ a, noko ɔnyi ɔbayɛ mbaka mgbole ne mɔ anu ko, na ɔyɛ ngane ndendenle dɔɔnwo mɔɔ nloma yɛ bɛ sane wɔ nu na bɛanyia ɛleka bɛala la.”<verse eid="MRK 4:31-32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Ɔvale zɛhae mrɛlɛ dɔɔnwo ɔhilehilele menli ne mekɛ dɔɔnwo ne ala kɛmɔ bɛkɛhola ɔ bo te la. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Nɔhalɛ, ɔvale mrɛlɛbulɛ ngome ala a ɔhilehilele bɛdabɛ menli dɔɔnwo ne a, na nzinlii, saa ɔka ɔ ngome nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ a, yɛɛ akee ɔkile mrɛlɛ ne mɔ abo ɔkile bɛ a.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Na mɔɔ ɛnee maanle nu ɛlɛba aramua la, Gyisɛse zele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Bɛmaa yɛpɛ azule tandane ne yɛhɔ ɔ nzi lɔ noko.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Ɔti bɛvale ye wɔ ɛlɛne nu, na bɛgyakyile menli dɔɔnwo ne mɔ wɔ ɛkɛ, noko akee menli ne bie mɔ doale bɛ wɔ nlɛne nu. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Na yeangyɛ biala ahumu ɛzulolɛ bie dule. Azɛlɛkye mgbole mgbole bie bɔle bɛ bo kɛ bɛkɔ ɛlɛne ne anu, mɔɔ anrɛɛ bɛyi ye a, na ɔlua zo anrɛɛ ɛlɛne ne noma bɔbɔ! <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Mekɛ ɛhye anu, ɛnee Gyisɛse ɛva esumi ɛzɔ ɔ ti na yela wɔ ɛlɛne ne ako abo nehane. Bɛvale ɛzulolɛ bɛdunwuele ye, na bɛdeɛdeanle nu bɛzele ye kɛ, “Awulae, na asoo ɔnvale ɛ nwo bɔbɔ kɛ asɛɛ yɛ muala yɛkpondɛ yɛanloma ɔ?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Akee ɔdeanle ahumu ne nu na ɔzele nyevile ne kɛ, “Gyinla dii!” Na anwoma ne anloa bɔle aze, na ɛkɛ ne yɛle kɛnlanana zɛhae!<verse eid="MRK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Akee ɔbizale ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Duzu ati a bɛ ahonle dule zɛ a? Yemɔti bɛnlɛ diedi biala wɔ me nu ɔ?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Na azibɛnwo hanle bɛ muala na akee bɛzele bɛ nwo ngoko ngoko kɛ, “Duzu sonla a le ɛhye, mɔɔ ahumu nee nyevile bɔbɔ tie ye a?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Agbolike wu, na sonla de aze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1-2" />Mekɛ mɔɔ bɛdwule aze wɔ azule tandane ne anzi nehane la, nrenyia bie mɔɔ bozonle ɛva ye la vi azie ne azo nriandinle rale wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɛnee bɔ zo mɔɔ Gyisɛse ɛlɛdwu file zo la.<verse eid="MRK 5:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3-4" />Nrenyia ɛhye de sɛka-awolɛ ne mɔ avinli, na ɔlua ye anwosesebɛ ti saa bɛgua ye nwɔnzɔnwɔnzɔ biala a ɛnee yetete nu yelie ɔ nwo yehɔ. Awie biala noko ɛngola ɛngye ye ɛmbɔ ye kpanwu. <verse eid="MRK 5:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Alehyenlɛ nee aledwolɛ muala ɔkpɔsa azɛka ne mɔ azo na ɔteɛdea nu ɔkpɔsa awoka ne mɔ azo, na ɔfa awole ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛ nloa yɛ nla la bie ɔpepɛ ɔ nwo nane.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse tɛbɔ azule tandane ne anye bɔbɔ la, yɛɛ nrenyia ne nwunle ye a, ɔti ɔvale ɛnriandinlɛ ɔrapɛle ɔfinle Gyisɛse anyunlu ɛkɛ ne.<verse eid="MRK 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7-8" />Na Gyisɛse zele bozonle ne mɔɔ wɔ ye nu la kɛ, “Ɛvi ye nu finde, wɔmɔ sunsum evinli.” Ɔvale ɛnelɛ ɛzulolɛ bie ɔkponlenle ɔ bo kɛ, “Gyisɛse, Anwuma Nyamenle Bedevinli ne Ara, duzu a ɛbava wɔayɛ me a? Ɔlua Awulae ati, mmasɛkye me!”<verse eid="MRK 5:7-8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Gyisɛse bizale ye kɛ, “Na kɛ bɛfɛlɛ wɔ ɛ?” Sunsum evinli ne buale ye kɛ, “Ɛlɔne, anzɛɛ Ɛdodo, ɔluakɛ yɛzonle a yewɔ nrenyia ɛhye nu a.”<verse eid="MRK 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Na akee sunsum evinli anzɛɛ awozonle ne mɔ bodole ye fane dɔɔnwo ne ala kɛ ɔmmafoa bɛ ɔmaa bɛkɔ moa.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Ɛnee agbolike kpolane bie luolua boka ne azo wɔ azule tandane ne anloa. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Ɔti awozonle ne mɔ bodole ye kɛ, “Maa yɛhɔwole agbolike ne mɔ nu.”<verse eid="MRK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Gyisɛse noko maanle bɛ adenle. Na awozonle ne mɔ vile nrenyia ne nu vindele, na bɛhɔwolole agbolike ne mɔ nu, na akee bɛ muala bɛdule twi, bɛvile kpomgbonloma ne azo bɛhɔguale azule tandane ne anu na bɛnlomanle bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Agbolikeneavolɛma ne mɔ nriandinle hɔle namunamu mɔɔ zuozua ɛkɛ ne la azo, na bɛhanle mɔɔ ɛzi la amuala. Awie biala pelele rale kɛ ɔbanlea ye ɔdaye ɔ nye zo. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Na yeangyɛ biala yɛɛ menli ekpunli dɔɔnwo bie rayiale ɛleka mɔɔ Gyisɛse wɔ la a; na mɔɔ amgba ala bɛnwunle kɛ nrenyia ne anye zo ɛtete ye bɔkɔɔ, na ɔheda ɛdanlɛ ɔde ɛkɛ la, bɛ ahonle dule kpole kpalɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛnwunle mɔɔ ɛzi la hanle hilele bɛ gɔnwo mɔ, <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />na akee menli ekpunli dɔɔnwo ne bodole Gyisɛse kɛ ɔvi bɛ nwo ɛkɛ ne ɔhɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Ɔti ɔhɔvole ɛlɛne ne anu bieko. Na nrenyia ne mɔɔ bozonle ne vale ye la zɛlɛle Gyisɛse kɛ ɔmaa ɔ nee ye ɛhɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Noko akee Gyisɛse amkponle ɛhye azo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:19">Ɔzele ye kɛ, “Kɔ sua nu na kɔha mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle ɛyɛ ɛmaa wɔ la nee Ye nwanwane ninyɛne ne amuala kile ɛ gɔnwo mɔ; ɔ nee anwunvɔne mɔɔ yeze yemaa wɔ la.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Ɔti nrenyia ne hɔle Azua Bulu ne mɔ azo wɔ maanzinli ne anu, na ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔka mɔɔ Gyisɛse ɛyɛ ɛmaa ye la ɔkile awie biala; na ye edwɛkɛ ne zinle awie biala anwo.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayileyɛlɛ nwo nwanwanendeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse vole ɛlɛne nu dwule azule tandane ne anzi lɔ la, menli ekpunli dɔɔnwo bie rabɔyiale ye wɔ ɛnwea ne azo.<verse eid="MRK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Na Gyeeyaelɛse, mɔɔ nea ɛkɛ ne asɔne ne azo la rahotole Gyisɛse, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />na ɔbodole ye kɛ ɔrayɛ ɔ ra raalɛ ekyi bie ayile. Ɔvale abodelɛ ɔzele kɛ, “Ɔka ekyii ɔwu. Mesɛlɛ wɔ, bɛla bava ɛ sa mgbane bɔbɔ gua ɔ nwo zo maa ɔnyia ngoane.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Gyisɛse nee ye hɔle, na menli dɔɔnwo ne noko doale bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Na raalɛ bie wɔ menli ne anu mɔɔ mogya ɛdu ye dedee ɛvolɛ bulu nee nwiɔ a. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Yenwu amaneɛ wɔ dɔketama nee ninsivolɛma dɔɔnwo asa anu, na yezɛkye ye ezukoa kpokpoti, ɔlua zo yeyɛ ehyianli noko akee ɔ nwo anza ekyi bɔbɔ, ye ewule ne dɛlale dɛba ne. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Yede Gyisɛse nwanwanendeɛ ne mɔɔ yeyɛ la nganeɛ, na ɔlua ɛhye noko ati ɔwolole menli ɛwolaa ne anu dedee ɔrazɔle ye tɛladeɛ ne anu.<verse eid="MRK 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Ɔhanle ye ɔ ti anu kɛ, “Saa mesɔ ye tɛladeɛ ne anu mgbane bɔbɔ a, me nwo baza.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Na amgba noko ɔzɔle ye nu ala la, mogya ne mɔɔ tu ye la pɛle, na ɔdele ye wɔ ye nu kɛ ɔ nwo ɛza bɔbɔ!<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Na ɛkɛ ne ala Gyisɛse nwunle kɛ ye ayileyɛlɛ tumi ne ɛvi ye nu; ɔti ɔdole ɔ nye wɔ menli dɔɔnwo ne anu, na ɔbizale kɛ, “Nwane a zɔle me tɛladeɛ ne anu a?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Na ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ buale ye zele kɛ, “Ɛdawɔ ɛnea menli dɔɔnwo ɛhye mɔɔ doa wɔ la a, kɛ ɔsi mɔɔ akee ɛbiza kɛ, nwane a zɔle wɔ a?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Gyisɛse noko totole ɔ nye kɛ saa ɔkɛnwu ahenle mɔɔ zɔle ye la wɔ menli ne anu a. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Na mɔɔ ɔtoto ɔ nye la, raalɛ ne vale ɛzulolɛ nee ahonledulɛ rahotole ɔ gyakɛ abo ɛkɛ, na ɔhanle mɔɔ yeyɛ la amuala ɔhilele Gyisɛse <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Na Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Ralɛ raalɛ, wɔ diedi ɛmaa wɔde kpɔkɛ; kɔ anzondwolɛ nu, na ɛ nwo ɛza bɔkɔɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Na mɔɔ ɔ nloa wɔ zo ɔtendɛ ɔkile ye la, ezuavolɛ bie vi Gyeeyaelɛse sua nu vale nrɛlaleɛ rale kɛ yekpa nwole, ɔ ra raalɛ ne ɛwu dɛbadɛba, na sɛkɛlɛneɛ biala noko ɛngile kɛ Gyisɛse ɛlɛba kɛkala bɔbɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Na Gyisɛse anva bɛ ngehanleɛ ne mɔ anyɛ edwɛkɛ, na ɔzele Gyeeyaelɛse kɛ, “Mmasulo! Wɔmɔ nyia diedi wɔ me nu.”<verse eid="MRK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Akee Gyisɛse gyinlanle menli dɔɔnwo ne amuala; na ɔhale Pita, Gyemise, nee Dwɔn ala mɔɔ ɔ nee bɛ hɔle Gyeeyaelɛse sua nu a. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Mɔɔ bɛdwule sua nu la, Gyisɛse nwule kɛ ɛkɛ ne ɛzoa begyebegye zɛhae ala, na ɛzunlɛ nee awolɛyelɛ noko gyi zo wuluwulu zɛhae. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Ɔwolole sua ne anu na ɔdendɛle ɔhilele menli ne mɔ kɛ,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:39">“Na ɛzunlɛ nee awolɛyelɛ nee dede ɛhye mɔ abo a le boni? Kakula ne ɛtɛwule; yela ala!”<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Menli ne mɔ zelele ye na bɛzile ye amgbu, na yemɔ ɔmaanle awie biala vindele, na ɔ nee kakula ne ɔ ze nee ɔ nli nee ɔdaye ye ɛdoavolema nsa ne mɔ bɛhɔle ekpumgbunli ne mɔɔ kakula ne la nu la anu.<verse eid="MRK 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41-42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41-42" />Ɔzɔle kakula raalɛ ne asa na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Talita Kumi,” ye ngilenu a le kɛ, “Kakula raalɛ, dwazo!” Ɛnee yeli ɛvolɛ bulu nee nwiɔ ala. Na ɛkɛ ne ala ɔwulule ɔgyinlanle na ɔdiediale! Na ye awovolɛma ne mɔ angola nwolɛ didi bɔbɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:41-42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Akee Gyisɛse bɔle bɛ kɔkɔ ɛsesebɛ ɛsesebɛ kɛ, bɛmmaka mɔɔ ɛzi la bɛkile awie biala, na nzinlii ɔzele bɛ kɛ bɛmaa kakula raalɛ ne debie bɛmaa ɔli.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Amozi ye ɔ nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ziale rale Nazalɛte ye sua zo. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2-3" />Na mɔɔ Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle bieko dwule la, ɔhɔle ayiasua ne anu kɛ ɔkahile debie, na ye nrɛlɛbɛ nee ye nwanwanendeɛ ne mɔ zinle menli ne mɔ anwo, ɔluakɛ, ɔle ɛkulomani kɛ bɛdabɛ ala la.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:2-3">Ɛhye ati bɛzele kɛ, “Ɔndɛla yɛ wɔ debie biala anu. Ɔle kapentanli ala. Ɔ nli a le Male, yɛɛ ɔ mediema noko a le Gyemise, ɔ nee Dwosefi, Dwudase, yɛɛ Saemɔn. Yɛɛ ɔ mediema mraalɛ ne mɔ noko nee yɛ a de a.” Na bɛambu ye bie, ɔluakɛ ɛya hunle bɛ somaa!<verse eid="MRK 6:2-3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Na akee Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Kapezonli biala lɛ anyunlunyia wɔ ɛleka biala, kyesɛ wɔ ye sua zo nee ye awovolɛma avinli nee ɔdaye mumua ne ye abusua nu.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Na ɔlua bɛ diedi mɔɔ bɛnlɛ la ati, yeangola yeanyɛ nwanwanendeɛ ɛzulolɛ biala wɔ bɛ nu, na emomu, wuliravolɛma ekyi bie ala a ɔvale ɔ sa ɔguale bɛ nwo zo ɔmaanle bɛ nwo zale a. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Na yeanlie yeanli amgba ala kɛ bɛnrɛnyia diedi wɔ ye nu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Akee ɔhɔle namunamu ne mɔ anu kɛ ɔkahilehile bɛ debie. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Ɔvɛlɛle ye ɛdoavolɛma bulu nee nwiɔ ne mɔ na ɔzoanle bɛ nwiɔ nwiɔ, na ɔmaanle bɛ tumi kɛ bɛva bɛdu awozonle awozonle. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8-9" />Ɔzele bɛ kɛ bɛmmafa debie biala, kyesɛ bɛ agbɔma ala. Ɔse, bɛmmafa aleɛ, kodoku, ezukoa, anzɛɛ mgbɔlaboa nee ndɛladeɛ gyɛne biala bɔbɔ bɛboka mɔɔ bɛwula la anwo.<verse eid="MRK 6:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Eza ɔzele bɛ kɛ “Sua biala mɔɔ bɛkɛdwu zo la, bɛzokoɛ aako ko ala anu, bɛmmawolowolo azua azua.” <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Ɔvale ɔzɔle zo kɛ: “Sua biala mɔɔ ɛnrɛlie bɛ, anzɛɛ ɛnrɛdie bɛ la, saa bɛkɔ a bɛkpokpo bɛ mgbɔlaboa ne mɔ abo ɛnwea ne bɛgua ɛkɛ kolaa na bɛavi ɛkɛ ne; ɛhye le sɛkɛlɛneɛ kɛ bɛgyakyi ye bɛmaa ɔdaye ye gyinlabelɛ biala mɔɔ ɔwɔ nu la.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Ɔti amgba noko ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ zile nu hɔle, na bɛzele menli biala mɔɔ bɛ nee bɛ yiale la kɛ bɛhwe bɛ nwo bɛvi ɛtane nwo. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Yɛɛ eza noko bɛdule awozonle dɔɔnwo, na bɛvale “Ɔlivi” nwole bɛyɛle wuliravolɛma ayile.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dwɔn ɛwulɛ ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Na yeangyɛ biala yɛɛ Belemgbunli Hɛlɔdo dele Gyisɛse nganeɛ a, ɔluakɛ, ɛnee ye nwanwanendeɛ ne mɔ anwo edwɛkɛ ɛzande ɛleka biala. Belemgbunli ne dwenlenle kɛ Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne a ɛdwazo ɛra ngoane nu bieko a. Ɛhye ati menli ne zele kɛ, “Ɔnyɛ ɛzulolɛ kɛ ɔkola ɔyɛ nwanwanendeɛ ɛhye mɔ a.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Bie mɔ noko dwenlenle kɛ Yilaegya mɔɔ ɔle tete kapezonli ne la a ɛzia ɛra ngoane nu bieko a; yɛɛ bie mɔ noko adwenle a le kɛ kapezonli fofolɛ bie mɔɔ ɔle kɛ dɛba ne mgbanyima ne mɔ la bie ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Na Hɛlɔdo zele kɛ, “Kyɛkyɛ, Dwɔn mɔɔ memaanle bɛpɛle ɔ ti la yemɔ yɛɛ ɛdwazo ɛra ngoane nu a.”<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17-18" />Ɛnee Hɛlɔdo ɛzoa azogya kɛ bɛhɔhye Dwɔn bɛdo ye efiade, ɔluakɛ, yemɔ Dwɔn ɔzele Hɛlɔdo kɛ ɔtia mɛla kɛ ɔkɛgya Hɛlɔdease, mɔɔ ɔle ɔdaye ɔ diema Felepe aye la. <verse eid="MRK 6:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Hɛlɔdease hulole kɛ bɛkɛhu Dwɔn, noko wɔ melɛ ala mɔɔ Hɛlɔdo ɛtɛmaanle ye adenle la, ɔnlɛ tumi biala. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Na kɛmɔ Hɛlɔdo noko nwunle kɛ Dwɔn le sonlakpalɛ, na eza ɔle nwuanzanwuanzanli la ati, ɔwowale ye dahuu ne ala. Mekɛ biala mɔɔ Hɛlɔdo nee Dwɔn kɛdendɛ la, ye adwenle yɛ ye kesee, noko akee ɛhye mɔ amuala anzi bɔbɔ, ɔhulole kɛ dahuu ɔkɛdie ye.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Hɛlɔdease munzule adwenle ne mekɛ dwule wɔ Hɛlɔdo awole kenle pilasilililɛ ne abo. Hɛlɔdo dole ɛkponle kpole bie maanle ye boavolɛma ne mɔ nee ye azogya mgbanyinli, nee bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛdi munli wɔ Galeli maanle ne anu la amuala. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22-23" />Akee Hɛlɔdease ara raalɛ bie rale ɛkɛ ne razile agole mɔɔ maanle awie biala anye liele a. Ɛhye ati Hɛlɔdo bɔle ye ɛwɔkɛ ɔzele ye kɛ, “Biza me debie biala mɔɔ ɛkulo la, na ɛ sa baha ye; saa me belemgbunli maanle ne foa ko bɔbɔ a mebava meamaa wɔ!”<verse eid="MRK 6:22-23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Bɛlɛra ne noko hɔfetele zo hilele ɔ nli, na ɔ nli noko zele ye kɛ, “Kɔbiza na die Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne ati ne bɛla!”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Amgba noko ɔvale ɛnriandinlɛ ndɛndɛ ne ala ɔhɔzele belemgbunli ne kɛ, “Mekpondɛ Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne ati kanrɛlɛ ne kɛkala, mɔɔ ɔla apawa zo a!”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Ɛhye yɛle belemgbunli ne nyane totohyia, noko akee yeangulo kɛ ɔkɛbulu ye ɛwɔkɛ ne azo wɔ ye menli ne mɔɔ bɛyia ɛkponledolɛ ne abo la anyunlu. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Ɛhye ati, ɔzoanle ye sinzavolɛma ne mɔ ko wɔ efiade ne kɛ ɔhɔpɛ Dwɔn ati ne ɔrɛlɛ ye. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Amgba noko sogyanli ne hɔhunle Dwɔn wɔ efiade ne, na ɔvale ɔ ti ne ɔdole apawa zo ɔrale, na ɔvale ɔmaanle bɛlɛra ne, na ɔdaye noko ɔvale ɔhɔmaanle ɔ nli.<verse eid="MRK 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Na mɔɔ Dwɔn ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ dele mɔɔ ɛzi la, bɛravale ye funli ne na bɛhɔziele ye.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse maanle menli apenle nnu aleɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Gyisɛse ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ noko vi bɛ ɛzoanlɛ ne rale, na bɛrahanle mɔɔ bɛyɛle nee mɔɔ bɛhanle la amuala bɛhilele ye.<verse eid="MRK 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Na Gyisɛse noko zele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛmaa yɛvi menli dɔɔnwo ɛhye anu yɛhɔlie yɛ menle ekyii.” Ɔluakɛ, ɔlua menli dɔɔnwo ne mɔɔ ɛnee bɛlɛkɔ na bie mɔ noko ɛlɛba la ati bɛannyia adenle bɛamkpula bɛ sa bɔbɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Ɔti bɛvale ɛlɛne bɛhɔle ɛleka mɔɔ ɔle koonwu la. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Noko akee menli dɔɔnwo ne ala nwunle bɛ ɛhɔlɛ nu na bɛnriandinle bɛlumuale bɛ nyunlu wɔ ɛnwea ne azo na bɛ muala bɛdwule ɛkɛ ne ko. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Ɛhye maanle menli dɔɔnwo ne ala rayiale Gyisɛse bieko; na ɔnwunle bɛ anwunvɔne, ɔluakɛ, ɛnee bɛyɛ kɛ mboane mɔɔ ɛnlɛ bɛ neavolɛ la, na akee ɔhilehilele bɛ ninyɛne dɔɔnwo mɔɔ ɔhyia kɛ bɛnwu ye la.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35-36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35-36" />Mɔɔ sɛnzɛne ne hɔle bie la, ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ rale ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne razele ye kɛ, “Ka kile menli ne maa bɛhɔ namunamu nee ɛya ɛya mɔɔ bikye ɛke la azo bɛhɔdɔ debie bɛli, ɔluakɛ, aleɛ biala ɛnle ɛsɛlɛ ye azo ɛke ɛmmaa bɛ, yɛɛ aleɛ ɛlɛdwo noko.”<verse eid="MRK 6:35-36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛdabɛ bɛmaa bɛ aleɛ ɛ.” Na bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Duzu a yɛva yɛmaa bɛ a? Kyesɛ ezukoa dɔɔnwo na ahola adɔ menli ɛwolaa ɛhye mɔ anwo aleɛ!”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Gyisɛse bizale bɛ kɛ, “Duzu aleɛ dodo a yɛlɛ ye kɛkala a? Bɛmaa menwu ye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Bɛziale bɛrale na bɛhanle bɛhilele ye kɛ, kpanwo dolɔfo nnu ɔ nee fɛlɛ nwiɔ ala a bɛlɛ ye wɔ bɛ nwo a. <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39-40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39-40" />Gyisɛse akee maanle menli dɔɔnwo ne dɛnlanle aze wɔ ndile ne azo ekpunli ekpunli mɔɔ wɔ nu abulanlu abulanlu ɔ nee ɛya ɛya la.<verse eid="MRK 6:39-40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Gyisɛse vale kpanwo dolɔfo nnu ne nee fɛlɛ nwiɔ ne, na ɔnleanle anwomanyunlu, na ɔyɛle Nyamenle mo. Akee ɔbubule kpanwo dolɔfo nnu ne nee fɛlɛ nwiɔ ne anu ngyikyi ngyikyi bie, ɔvale kpanwo ne nee fɛlɛ ne bie ɔmaanle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ko biala, ɔmaanle bɛvale bɛzieziele menli ne mɔ anyunlu. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Na menli dɔɔnwo ne lile maanle bɛ ko yile mɔɔ ɛnee akee bɛngola bieko bɔbɔ di a.<verse eid="MRK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43-44" />Ɛnee mrenyia mɔɔ wɔ nu la le kɛyɛ apenle nnu, na nzinlii, bɛsesale mgbokpoleka ne la bɛnyianle ahɛndɛne bulu nee nwiɔ!<verse eid="MRK 6:43-44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Bɛwiele ɛhye ala la Gyisɛse maanle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ dule ɛlɛne lumuale azule tandane ne anzi bɛhɔle Bɛteseeyeda. Yemɔ ɔhale amozi kɛ ɔnea ɔ nee menli ne mɔ ali nrɛlaleɛ na yeanlea yeamaa bɛadwu sua nu kolaa na akee yeadoa bɛ.<verse eid="MRK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Ɛhye anzi bɔbɔ, eza ɔhɔle awoka ne azo kɛ ɔkazɛlɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Mɔɔ aleɛ dwole la, ɛnee ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ tɛbɔ azule tandane ne anye avinli, na yemɔ ɔ ngome noko ɔwɔ file zo lɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Na ɔnwunle kɛ bɛ nwo ɛhyele bɛ kpalɛ kpalɛ wɔ ahumu nee azɛlɛkye sa nu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:48">Bɛbɔle kɛyɛ aleɛbahye dɔne nsa la, ɔdiale azule ne anye ɔdoale bɛ ɔyɛle kɛ ɔsea bɛ nwo; <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />na mɔɔ bɛnwunle kɛ debie bie nee bɛ lua la, ɛzulolɛ hanle bɛ maanle bɛdeɛdeanle nu, ɔluakɛ, ɛnee bɛdwenle kɛ nwomenle bie ɔ, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />ɔluakɛ bɛ muala noko bɛnwunle ye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Na ndɛndɛ ne ala ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛmmasulo. Bɛgyinla bɛ nwo nane dii! Medame ɔ!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Akee ɔvole ɛlɛne ne anu, na ahumu ne gyakyile!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:51">Ɔyɛle bɛ muala azibɛnwo. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Ɔluakɛ ɛnee bɛtɛnwunle ye sonla holɛ, bɔbɔ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ ɔyɛle nwanwane ninyɛne ne mɔɔ ɔyɛle ye wɔ kpanwo ne anwo nɔsolɛ zɔhane mɔɔ ɛze ɛhɔ la! Yɛɛ bɛangulo noko kɛ bɛkɛlie bɛkɛli!<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Mɔɔ bɛdwule Gɛnɛzalɛte wɔ azule tandane ne anzi lɔ la, bɛdole bɛ ɛlɛne ne sɛkɛ, <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />na akee bɛvole file zo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:54">Menli mɔɔ gyigyi ɛkɛ ne la nwunle Gyisɛse ndɛndɛ ne ala, <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />ɔti bɛnriandinle bɛhɔbɔle ye ɛralɛ ne anwo nolo wɔ ɛkɛ ne ɛleka biala, na bɛzoale wuliravolɛma wɔ ɛkpa zo nee ahomanga nu bɛrale ɔ nyunlu ɛkɛ ne. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Ɛleka biala mɔɔ ɔvale la, saa namule nu nee sua zo o, saa ɛbɔ nu o, ɛnee bɛzo wuliravolɛma bɛdoa ye wɔ gua ne mɔ nee awɔlɔne ne mɔ azo na bɛlɛsɛlɛ ye kɛ ɔmaa bɛzɔ ye tɛladeɛ ne anloa anloa mgbane bɔbɔ; na nuhua biala noko mɔɔ zɔle ye nu la dele kpɔkɛ bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Asɔne mgbanyima ne mɔ vunvuanle Gyisɛse anwo edwɛkɛ nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Kenle ko bie Dwuuma azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ bie vi Gyɛlusalɛm rale kɛ bɛbavunvua Gyisɛse anwo edwɛkɛ nu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Na bɛnwunle kɛ ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bie ɛnli Dwuuma aleɛlilɛ nwo mɛla ne azo. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Ɔluakɛ, Dwuuma, bɔbɔ Falasiima ne mɔ, ɛnli aleɛ wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ bɛtɛwowole bɛ sa anwo too mɔɔ kɔ bɛ awane zo la, kɛmɔ bɛ mɛla dɛba ne se la. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Yemɔti saa bɛvi gua zo bɛba na bɛtɛyɛle ɛhye a, bɛnzɔ aleɛ nu. Ɛhye le bɛ tete amaamuo ne mɔ anu ndonwo ko ala, mɔɔ bɛyɛ ye nzonlɛ mekɛ tendenle ne ala na bɛtedi zolɛ noko a, yɛɛ bie noko a le mbuakɛ, ahyɛnze nee pɛlɛte pɛlɛte mɔ ɛkpudalɛ ɛvoyia ne.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Ɛhye ati Dwuuma azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ bizale ye kɛ, “Duzu ati a wɔ ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ɛnli yɛ tete mɛla ne mɔ azo a? Ɔluakɛ bɛnwowo bɛ sa anwo kolaa na bɛali aleɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6-7" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Bɛmɛ adalɛ nabalabama! Kapezonli Ayezaya hanle bɛ nwo edwɛkɛ nɔhalɛ ne bɔkɔɔ kɛ, ‘Menli ɛhye mɔ fa bɛ nloa kanvo Awulae, noko akee bɛnlɛ ɔ nwo ɛhulolɛ fee zɛ. Bɛ ɛzonlenlɛ ne le gyɛne, ɔluakɛ bɛka bɛtu bɛ nwo kɛ Nana Nyamenle a yele menli ne mɔ ketee maa bɛdi bɛ mɛla ngyikyi ngyikyi ɛhye mɔ azo a.’ Ayezaya amgba hanle nɔhalɛ ne bɔkɔɔ! <verse eid="MRK 7:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Ɔboalekɛ, bɛbu bɛ nye bɛgua Nana Nyamenle mɛla titili ne mɔ azo, na bɛfa bɛdabɛ bɛ ti anwo amaamuo bɛsie ɔ bo zo. <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Bɛtietia Nyamenle mɛla ne mɔ azo na bɛkpo kɛ bɛkɛli zo ɔlua tete amaamuo ti.<verse eid="MRK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />“Bɛnlea ɛhye bɔbɔ: Mosisi vale Nyamenle mɛla ɛhye maanle bɛ kɛ, ‘Di ɛ ze nee ɛ nli eni’ Na ɔzele kɛ awie biala mɔɔ kɛdendɛ kɛtia ɔ ze anzɛɛ ɔ nli la ɔwɔ kɛ ɔwu. <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Noko bɛmɛ bɛse, saa awie se ɔnrɛnlea ye awovolɛma na ɔka kɛ, ‘Mɔɔ anrɛɛ menwɔva menwɔmaa bɛ la a meva memaa Nyamenle la’ a, ɛnee bɛse ɔfa mɛla nu. <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12-13" />Ɔba ye zɔ noko a, ɛnee ɔkile kɛ bɛlɛbu Nyamenle mɛla ne azo wɔ bɛdabɛ bɛ-sa anloa amaamuo ngyehyɛleɛ ti. Na ɛhye le ndonwo ko ala. Dɔɔnwo ne ala wɔ ɛkɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 7:12-13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Akee Gyisɛse vɛlɛle menli dɔɔnwo ne zele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛ muala bɛdie, na bɛnyia ndelebɛbo. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15-16" />Tɛ debie mɔɔ bɛdi la a gua bɛ nwo evinli a, na emomu mɔɔ bɛdwenle nwo nee mɔɔ bɛka la ɔ!”<verse eid="MRK 7:15-16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Na ɔvile menli dɔɔnwo ne anye zo ɔhɔle sua nu la, ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bizale ye edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ ɔhanle la abo.<verse eid="MRK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Na ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Ɔti bɛdabɛ noko bɛnde ɔ bo ɔ? Bɛngola bɛnnwu kɛ mɔɔ bɛdi la ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛgyegye bɛ ɛkɛla ne mɔ ɔ? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Ɔluakɛ aleɛ mɔɔ bɛdi la nee bɛ ahonle ne ɛnyia nu, na emomu, ɔdua ɛkolɛ nee anyanlɛ ne anu dedee yɛɛ ɔfinde wɔ bakazohɔlɛ nu a.”<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Na ɔhanle ɔzɔle zo kɛ, “Mɔɔ vi adwenle nu ba la a gua sonla nwo evinli a. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Ɔluakɛ menli ahonle ne mɔ anu a ɛtane ɛhye mɔ: ɛhulolɛ funli, awuleyɛlɛ, sonlahunlɛ, awuvolɛvalɛ, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />awie mɔ debie mɔɔ tɛ wɔ deɛ la ɛkpondɛlɛ, adwenle nzuzulɛ ɛtane, ɛbɛlɛbɛlalɛ, ɛkpɔlɛ mgbane mgbane, anyeboloyɛlɛ, ndɛneyelɛ, mgbanyizonleyɛlɛ, nee ngoaseade anzɛɛ ɛdindanlɛ muala vi ba a. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Ninyɛne evinli evinli ɛhye mɔ amuala vi sonla ahonle ne anu a ba a; na bɛmɛ noko a bɛgua sonla nwo evinli wɔ Nana Nyamenle anyunlu a.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ye nyɛleɛ biala yɛ azibɛnwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Akee Gyisɛse vile Galeli na ɔhɔle Taya nee Saedɛn maanzinli ne anu; na ɔbɔle mɔdenle biala kɛ ɔfea ɔ nwo, noko akee yeanyɛ boɛ. Na kɛmɔ ɔde ye dɛba ne ala la, ye ɛralɛ ne anwo edwɛkɛ zandele ndɛndɛ ne ala.<verse eid="MRK 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Na ɛkɛ ne ala raalɛ bie vale ɔ ra raalɛ mɔɔ bozonle ɛwolo ye nu la rɛlɛle ye. Ɛnee yede Gyisɛse nganeɛ, ɔti ɔrapɛle ɔfinle ɔ nyunlu ɛkɛ, <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />na ɔbodole ye kɛ ɔmaa bozonle ne ɛvi ɔ ra ne nu. (Na raalɛ ɛhye noko “ɛnle Dwuunli” ɔle ɛyɛvolɛ bie mɔɔ, ɔvi Fonehyea wɔ Selea maanle nu a).<verse eid="MRK 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Ɛhye ati Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Ɔwɔ kɛ medumua meboa me abusua, Dwuuma ne mɔ. Ɔnva mɛla nu kɛ menwɔva ngakula aleɛ mɔnwɔmaa ndwea a.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Raalɛ ne buale ye kɛ, “Yɛmenle, ɛhye le nɔhalɛ, noko akee ndwea mralɛ ne mɔ bɔbɔ mɔɔ gua ɛkponle ne abo la, ɔyɛ a bɛfa mgbokpoleka ne mɔɔ vi ngakula ne mɔ pɛlɛte ne anu bɔbɔ la bɛmaa bɛdabɛ noko.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Mo! Wɔbua ye boɛ somaa, ɛhye ati kɔ, na ɛ ra ne anwo ɛza, ɔluakɛ bozonle ne ɛvi ye nu!”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Na mɔɔ ɔdwule sua nu la, ɛnee amgba kakula raalɛ ne la ɛkpa nu koonwu, na bozonle ne ɛvi ye nu bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Ɔvile Taya la ɔhɔle Saedɛn, na akee ɔvale Azua Bulu ne (Dɛkapɔlese) adenle ne azo ɔziale ɔrale Galeli Nyevile ne ɛnweazo. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Bɛvale nrenyia bie mɔɔ anzo ɛdi na ɔle mumule la bɛrɛlɛle ye, na awie biala bodole Gyisɛse kɛ ɔva ɔ sa ɔgua ɔ nwo zo ɔmaa ɔ nwo ɛza.<verse eid="MRK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Ɔti Gyisɛse hwenle ye vile menli dɔɔnwo ne anu hɔle ahanle, na ɔvale ɔ sa mrɛlɛsɛka ɔwulale ɔ nzo nu; akee ɔdole nyɛlɛ na ɔvale ɔhanle nrenyia ne atafinlima. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Na ɔdole ɔ nye ɔnleanle anwuma, na ɔgule ɛnwomenle, na wɔ tumi nu ala, ɔzele kɛ, “Buke!” <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Ɛkɛ ne ala nrenyia ne dele edwɛkɛ kpalɛ kpalɛ na eza ɔholale tendɛ kpalɛ bɔkɔɔ!<verse eid="MRK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Gyisɛse zele menli dɔɔnwo ne kɛ bɛmmaka bɛkile awie biala, noko akee mɔɔ ɔka la ɛnee bɔ zo mɔɔ bɛlɛfa bɛakponde kpalɛ a, <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />ɔluakɛ, ɔyɛle awie biala azibɛnwo totohyia. Na bɛhanle bɛfunlanle nu kɛ, “Debie biala mɔɔ ɔyɛ la yɛ nwanwane; ɔmaa anzodiliravolɛ ɔ nee mumule bɔbɔ te edwɛkɛ, na eza noko bɛkola tendɛ kpalɛ!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1-2" />Kenle ko bie eza menli dɔɔnwo bie yiale bieko la, bɛ aleɛ eza wiele. Gyisɛse vɛlɛle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ na ɔ nee bɛ dwenledwenlenle nwo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:1-2">Ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Menli ɛhye mɔ anwo yɛ me anwunvɔne, ɔluakɛ bɛ nee yɛ ɛdɛnla ɛke too kenle nsa, mɔɔ aleɛ biala noko ɛnle ɛke ɛmmaa bɛ mɔɔ bɛdi a. <verse eid="MRK 8:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Saa megyakyi bɛ adenle memaa bɛkɔ sua nu wɔ melɛ mɔɔ bɛtɛdile debie la noko a, bɛ nye zo babulu bɛ wɔ adenle nu! Ɔluakɛ, bie mɔ vi adenle nzi moamoa kpalɛ a rale a.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ buale ye kɛ, “Na yɛmɛ ala a ɔwɔ kɛ yɛkpondɛ aleɛ wɔ ɛsɛlɛ resee ɛhye azo yɛmaa bɛ ɔ?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Kpanwo dolɔfo nyɛ a bɛlɛ ye wɔ ɛke a?” Bɛbuale ye kɛ, “Nsuu.” <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Akee ɔmaanle menli ne mɔ dɛnlanle aze. Na akee ɔmaanle kpanwo dolɔfo nsuu ne zo, na ɔyɛle Nyamenle mo, ɔbubule nu ngyikyi ngyikyi na ɔvale ɔmaanle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ bɛva bɛmaa menli dɔɔnwo ne. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Eza bɛnyianle fɛlɛ ekyii noko, ɔti Gyisɛse yilale ɔdaye noko azo, na ɔvale ɔmaanle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ bɛhyɛ bɛmaa menli ɛwolaa ne.<verse eid="MRK 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8-9" />Na bɛ muala bɛlile dedee bɛ ko yile tetɛkɛɛ, na akee nzinlii, ɔmaanle bɛ adenle ɔmaanle bɛhɔle bɛ azua nu. Bɛlua kɛyɛ apenle nna a bɛlile aleɛ ne kenle ko zɔhane a, na mɔɔ bɛsesale ɔ bo zo mgbokpoleka ne la, eza bɛnyianle ahɛndɛne mgbole tetɛkɛɛ nsuu!<verse eid="MRK 8:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nwanwanendeɛ nyɛ bieko a bɛhyia nwo a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Ɛhye pɛle nu ala la, ɔ nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ vole ɛlɛne nu na bɛrale Dalemanuta maanzinli nu. <verse eid="MRK 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Na mɔɔ Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ dele ye nganeɛ la bɛrale kɛ bɛba bɛarabizebiza ye edwɛkɛ. Bɛzele ye kɛ, “Yɛ nwanwane debie maa yɛnlea. Maa debie ɛzi wɔ anwomanyunlu na akee yɛbalie wɔ yɛali.”<verse eid="MRK 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Ɛhye zinle ɔ nwo totohyia, na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Ɛhye yemɔ, Kyɛkyɛ. Duzu nwanwanendeɛ bieko a bɛkponde a?”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Ɔti ɔziale ɔ nzi ɔvole ɛlɛne ne anu bieko na ɔgyakyile bɛ ɛkɛ ɔpɛle azule tandane ne ɔhɔle ɔ nzi nehane. <verse eid="MRK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Ɛnee ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ arɛle ɛvi kɛ bɛkɛva aleɛ, ɔti kpanwo dolɔfo ko pɛ ala a ɛnee ɛha a.<verse eid="MRK 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Na mɔɔ bɛpɛ azule tandane ne la, Gyisɛse zele bɛ ahunlunyele nu ala kɛ, “Bɛnlea bɛ nwo boɛ wɔ Hɛlɔdo nee Falasiima ne mɔ mgbɔvonle ne anwo.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Na ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ande ɔ bo, na bɛzele bɛ nwo ngoko ngoko kɛ, “Duzu a ɔkpondɛ yeahile a?” Amozi ye, akee bɛdwenlenle kɛ aleɛ mɔɔ bɛanva la ati a ɛmaa ɔlɛka ɛhye a.<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Na Gyisɛse nwunle mɔɔ bɛlɛsuzu nwo a, na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Kyɛkyɛ, tɛ ye zɔhane hweledede ɔ! Bɛnde ɛhye abo ɔ? Bɛ ahonle ne mɔ ɛyɛ ɛsesebɛ mɔɔ ɔti bɛnde ɛhwee abo anzɛɛ? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Ɔti a Ayezaya hanle la kɛ: ‘Bɛlɛ ɛnyelɛ, noko bɛnnwu debie. Duzu ati a bɛnyɛ bɛ nzo gyɛlɛɛnye na bɛndie a?’ Bɛngakye ɛhwee ɔ?<verse eid="MRK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />“Bɛngakye menli apenle nnu ne mɔɔ memaanle bɛ kpanwo dolɔfo nnu ala bɛlile mɔɔ bɛ ko yiyile la ɔ? Ɔ bo zo mgbokpoleka ahɛndɛne nyɛ a bɛsesale ye amozi ye a?” Bɛzele ye kɛ, “Bulu nee nwiɔ!”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“Na mɔɔ menvale kpanwo dolɔfo nsuu ne noko memaanle menli apenle nna ne noko lile la, ahɛndɛne nyɛ a hale ɔ bo a?” Bɛbuale ye kɛ, “Ahɛndɛne nsuu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />“Duzu ati a akee noko bɛtɛdwenle kɛ aleɛ mɔɔ yɛnle ye la ɛhyia me a?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Mɔɔ bɛdwule Bɛteseeyeda la, bɛvale nrenyia anyezinliravolɛ bie bɛrɛlɛle ye, na bɛbodole ye kɛ ɔva ɔ sa ɔha ye ɔmaa ɔde kpɔkɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Gyisɛse zɔle nrenyia anyezinliravolɛ ne asa, na ɔ nee ye vile namule ne azo bɛhɔle, na ɔdole nyɛlɛ ɔguale ɔ nye ne mɔ azo, na akee ɔvale ɔ sa ɔbutule ɔ nye ne mɔ azo. Gyisɛse bizale ye kɛ, “Akee ɛkola ɛnwu debie ɔ?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Nrenyia ne dole ɔ nye nleanle ahanle ahanle na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Ɛhɛe! Menwu menli! Na emomu mennwu bɛ kpalɛ; bɛzɔho mbaka azinli mɔɔ bɛlɛtia la!”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Akee Gyisɛse vale ɔ sa butule nrenyia ne anye ne mɔ azo bieko, na mɔɔ nrenyia ne nleanle ye kpoonwu la ɔ nye zo tetele ye wienyi, na akee ɔnwunle debie kpalɛ, na ɔlile fɛlɛko somaa ne ala.<verse eid="MRK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Gyisɛse akee maanle ɔhɔle ye awovolɛma sua nu. Na ɔzele ye kɛ, “Mmaka kɛ ɛkɔ namule ne azo bɔbɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔmɔ a ɛle ngoanedievolɛ ne a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Akee Gyisɛse nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ vile Galeli na bɛhɔle Sizalia Felepe namunamu ne mɔ azo. Na mɔɔ bɛlua adenle nu bɛkɔ la ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Kɛ menli si dwenle me ɛ? Duzu a bɛka ye wɔ me nwo a?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ buale ye kɛ, “Bie mɔ dwenle kɛ wɔmɔ a ɛle Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne a, yɛɛ bie mɔ noko se ɛle Yilaegya anzɛɛ mɔmoane ngapezoma ne mɔ bie mɔɔ ɛzia ɛra ngoane nu bieko a.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Akee ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Na bɛdabɛ noko bɛdwenle kɛ nwane a le me?” Na Pita buale kɛ, “Wɔmɔ a ɛle Ngoanedievolɛ ne a.” <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Na Gyisɛse bɔle bɛ kɔkɔ kɛ bɛmmaka bɛkile awie biala.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Akee ɔbɔle ɔ bo ɔhanle anwubɛnyunlu mɔɔ ɔbayia la ɔhilele bɛ kɛ, Yemɔ ɔdaye Sonla Ra ne, Asɔne mgbanyima ne mɔ nee Azɛlɛvolɛ Mgbanyinli ne mɔ nee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ baye ye bɛamaana bɛahu ye, na ye kenle nsa ne azo ɔbadwazo bieko. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Ɔhanle ɛhye anwo bie ɔhilele bɛ anyelielɛ nu ala, ɔti Pita hwenle ye hɔle ahanle na ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔtwi ɔ nyunlu. Ɔzele Gyisɛse kɛ, “Ɔnle kɛ ɛkɛha edwɛkɛ mɔɔ le kɛ ɛhye mɔ la.”<verse eid="MRK 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Gyisɛse hakyile ɔ nye nleanle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ amuala na akee ɔzele Pita wɔ kɔkɔbɔlɛ nu ala kɛ, “Kɔ nehane, Abɔnsam! Wɔmɔ menli adwenle a ɛlɛfa wɔado ɛhye anwo a na tɛ Nyamenle adwenle ne ɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Akee ɔvɛlɛle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ nee menli dɔɔnwo ne amuala kɛ bɛradie. Na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Saa bɛ nuhua bie kulo kɛ ɔyɛ me ɛdoavolɛ a, kyesɛ ɔkpo ɔ nwo ninyɛne nee ye anyelielɛ muala, na ɔsoa ye meanubaka ne, na ɔtoa me nanamogya nanamogya. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Saa wɔandie na ɛse kɛ ɛkpondɛ wɔ ngoane wɔalie ye a, ɛbaminli ye. Na mɔɔ kɛkpo ye ngoane wɔ Mame nee Edwɛkpa ne ati la yemɔ a banyia ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ a.<verse eid="MRK 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />“Na saa awie nyia ewiade amuala na ɔminli ye ɛkɛla a duzu nvasoɛ a ɔbanyia ye a? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Asoo debie bie wɔ ɛkɛ mɔɔ ɔhyia ɔtɛla ɔdaye sonla mumua ne ye ɛkɛla ɔ? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Na awie biala mɔɔ kɛze me nee me edwɛkpa ne anwo nyiane wɔ kpolerazulɛ nee ɛtaneyɛlɛ ewiade ɛhye anu la, Mame, Sonla Ra ne noko mebaze ɔ nwo nyiane wɔ mekɛ mɔɔ me nee anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔ bara wɔ Egya ne anyunlunyia nu la.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse wɔ ye anyunlunyia nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Gyisɛse doale zo zele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛgyigyi ɛke kɛkala la bie mɔ ɛnrɛnwu ewule ɛlɛ kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle Belemgbunli maanle ne kɛra wɔ tumi totohyia nu la!”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Na ye kenle nsia ne anzi Gyisɛse vale Pita, Gyemise, nee Dwɔn hɔle boka bie azo. Ɛnee awie bieko ɛmboka bɛ nwo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:2">Na arɛlevilɛ nu ala Gyisɛse anyunlu bɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔta kɛ sɛnzɛne kpalɛ wɔ anyunlunyia kpole nu, <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />na ye tɛladeɛ ne noko yɛle nwohyee dɛlale ewiade anu debie fufule biala! <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Na Mosisi nee Yilaegya vindele ɛkɛ ne na bɛ nee Gyisɛse dendɛle!<verse eid="MRK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Pita deanle nu zele kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ, ɛhye yɛ nwanwane kpole! Maa yɛdɛnla ɛke ala! Ɔnle kɛ yɛsia yɛ nzi bieko! Maa yɛbɔ kpɔda nsa: wɔ deɛ ko, Mosisi ɛdeɛ ko, yɛɛ Yilaegya noko deɛ ko.”<verse eid="MRK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Ɛnee ɔnnwu edwɛkɛ mɔɔ ɔka la ati a maanle ɔhanle ɛhye a, ɔluakɛ ɛnee bɛ nuhua biala ahonle ɛdu totohyia.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Na mɔɔ ɔ nloa wɔ zo ɔtendɛ la, amungu rahedale bɛ nee sɛnzɛne ne anwo zo, na ɛnelɛ bie vi amungu ne anu zele kɛ, “Ɛhye a le me Ra ne mɔɔ mekulo ye la. Bɛdie ye.”<verse eid="MRK 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Bɛtotole bɛ nye bɛnleanle bɛ nwo ɛkɛ ne la, bɛnwunle kɛ Mosisi nee Yilaegya ɛhɔ, na Gyisɛse angomekye ala a nee bɛ wɔ ɛkɛ ne a.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Na mɔɔ bɛtolotolo boka ne la, ɔzele bɛ kɛ bɛmmaka mɔɔ bɛnwu ye la bɛkile awie biala, kɔkpula mekɛ mɔɔ Sonla Ra ne vi ewule nu kɛdwazo la; <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Ɛhye ati bɛanga, na bɛveale zolɛ, na mekɛ dɔɔnwo ne ala bɛdwenlenle nwolɛ, na bɛbɔle mɔdenle kɛ bɛkɛde “ewule nu edwazolɛ” ne mɔɔ ɔhanle la abo.<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Akee bɛbɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛbiza ye Dwuuma ngilehile ne mɔɔ se, ɔwɔ kɛ Yilaegya sia ba kolaa na Ngoanedievolɛ ne ara la anwo edwɛkɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12-13" />Gyisɛse liele dole nu kɛ ɔwɔ kɛ Yilaegya dumua ba na ɔbasiezie Awulae adenle ne anu. Ɔvale ɔzɔle zo kɛ, nɔhalɛ nu, Yilaegya ɛra bieko dɛbadɛba! Na emomu, eza noko bɛhilele ye anwubɛnyunlu dɔɔnwo, kɛmɔ ngapezoma ne mɔ nwunle ye hanle ala la. Na akee Gyisɛse noko bizale bɛ edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ ngapezoma ne mɔ hanle, kɛ Ngoanedievolɛ ne bavɛ, ɔbanwu nyane, na eza noko menli atoto ɔ nyunlu nyɛlɛ la abo.<verse eid="MRK 9:12-13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse ɛra azɛlɛ ye azo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Bɛnwunle kɛ menli dɔɔnwo ɛbɔ ɛyia ɛdoavolɛma ngɔnla ne mɔ wɔ boka ne azo lɔ, na Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ bie noko nee bɛ ɛlɛsu kpolera. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Menli dɔɔnwo ne nwunle Gyisɛse la, ɛzulolɛ hanle bɛ, na bɛdule twi, kɛ bɛkayia ye. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Na ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Na kpolerazulɛ ɛhye noko fale duzu anwo?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Nrenyia ko vi menli ne anu zele kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ, menvale me ra ko membale kɛ bɛyɛ ye ayile, ɔngola tendɛ, ɔluakɛ bozonle ɛva ye. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Na mekɛ biala bozonle ne bawolo ye nu a ɔpɛ ye ɔto aze na akee ɔmaa ɔ nloa nyɛlɛ yɛ awubue fukaa, ɔtwi ɔ gye, na akee ɔsa kahelee zɛhae. Yemɔti mɔɔ me nee ye rale la membodole wɔ ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ bɛdu bozonle ne bɛvi ye nu, noko akee bɛangola.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Na Gyisɛse zele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “O, duzu ati a bɛ diedi le ekyi zɛhae a; me nee bɛ ɛdɛnla ɛhɔdwu kenle nzu bieko kolaa na bɛalie bɛali? Menzi bɛ nwo abotane mengɔnkpula kenle nzu bieko? Bɛva kakula nrenyia ne bɛrɛlɛ me wɔ ɛke.”<verse eid="MRK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Ɔti bɛ nee kakula nrenyia ne rale, na mɔɔ ɔnwunle Gyisɛse ala la, bozonle ne pɛle ye dole ye aze ɛzulolɛ nu ala maanle ɔbedebedele na ɔ nloa anu kpule awubue fukaa zɛhae.<verse eid="MRK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Gyisɛse bizale kakula ne ɔ ze kɛ, “Na zɛhae deɛ ye rale ɔ nwo la yeli kenle nyɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Kakula ne ɔ ze buale kɛ, “Sumunli ye ngakula nu a deɛ ne yɛle ye a, <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />na ɔtɔ kenle ne bie bɔbɔ a ɔmaa ɔtɔ senle nu, anzɛɛ nzule nu kɛ ɔku ye. Ɔti nwu ye anwunvɔne, na yɛ nwole bie maa yɛ, saa ɛkɛhola a.”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Saa Mame menwɔhola a! Saa ɛlɛ diedi ɛdeɛ a, yemɔ debie biala kola yɛ ɛkɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Ndɛndɛ ne ala selɛ ne buale ye kɛ, “Melɛ diedi; O, boa me maa menyia ye molozo!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Na mɔɔ Gyisɛse nwunle kɛ ɛlɔne ne anu ɛlɛpi la ɔdeanle bozonle ne nu kɛ,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:25">“Wɔmɔ bozonle tibili, wɔ tumi nu, ɛvi kakula ne nu finde na mmawolo ye nu bieko!”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Akee bozonle ne kponlenle ɔ bo basaa bie, na ɔpɛle kakula nrenyia ne ɔdole ye aze na ɔvile ye nu ɔhɔle; na kakula nrenyia ne lale ɛkɛ ne koonwu, kɛ asɛɛ yewu la. Bɛlɛbɛlɛyivo bie vale ɛnriandinlɛ vile menli ne anu razele kɛ “Yewu.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Na Gyisɛse nzinlii zɔle ɔ sa maanle ye zo, na ɔboale ye ɔmaanle ɔgyinlanle, na ɔdwazole, na akee ɔdele kpɔkɛ bɔkɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Na nzinlii mɔɔ ɔhale Gyisɛse angomekye nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ wɔ sua nu la bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Na duzu ati a yɛmɛ yɛangola yɛandu zɔhane bozonle ne a?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Zɛhae deɛ ye, yemɔ ɔhyia nzɛlɛlɛ ɛsesebɛ ɛsesebɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30-31" />Bɛvile zɔhane maanzinli ne anu la bɛdule adenle bɛvale Galeli. Ɛnee Gyisɛse adwenle a le kɛ ɔfi menli ɛwolaa ne anu amaa yeanyia mekɛ ɔ nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ adɛnla na yeahilehile bɛ debie. Edwɛkɛ mɔɔ ɛnee ɔta ɔka ɔkile bɛ la a le kɛ, “Bɛbaye Mame, Sonla Ra ne bɛamaa, na bɛahu me, na ye kenle nsa ne azo mebazia meara ngoane nu bieko.”<verse eid="MRK 9:30-31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Noko akee bɛande ɔ bo, yɛɛ bɛbiza ɔ bo noko a eza bɛsulo.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Na mɔɔ bɛdwule Kapɛnayɛm mɔɔ bɛdɛnlanle aze wɔ aako ne mɔɔ bɛkazokoɛ nu ala la, ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Duzu a ɛnee bɛlɛkeha nwolɛ edwɛkɛ wɔ adenle nu lɔ la a?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Na nyiane hunle bɛ kɛ bɛkɛbua ɛhye, ɔluakɛ, ɛnee bɛlɛkeha mɔɔ lɛ tumi kpole wɔ bɛ nu la anwo edwɛkɛ!<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Ɔdɛnlanle aze na ɔvɛlɛle bɛ wɔ ɔ nwo ɛkɛ na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Mɔɔ kpondɛ kɛ ɔyɛ bɛ nu tumivolɛ la ɔwɔ kɛ yɛ ɔ nwo kɛ yemɔ a ɔle bɛ nu kakula a, ɔwɔ kɛ ɔbu ɔ nwo kɛ akɛlɛ wɔ bɛ nu!”<verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Akee Gyisɛse vale kakula ekyi ko ziele bɛ avinli; na ɔmaanle kakula ne zo na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Awie biala mɔɔ kɛlie kakula ekyi zɛhae wɔ me duma nu la, ɛnee yelie me, yɛɛ awie biala noko mɔɔ kɛlie me la ɛnee yelie me Ze ne mɔɔ zoanle me la!”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Kenle ko bie Dwɔn mɔɔ ɔle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anu ko la zele ye kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ, yɛnwunle nrenyia bie kɛ ɔlɛfa wɔ duma yeadu awozonle; na yɛzele ye kɛ ɔmmayɛ zɔhane, ɔluakɛ ɔnle yɛ eku ne anu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Na Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ, “Mmatua ye! Ɔluakɛ, awie biala mɔɔ ɛlɛyɛ nwanwane ninyɛne wɔ me duma nu la ɛnrɛhola ɛnrɛhakyi ɔ nzi ɛnrɛzi me ndɛndɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Awie biala mɔɔ ɛntia yɛ la ɛnee ɔwɔ yɛ afoa. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Na nɔhalɛ nu mese bɛ kɛ, wie biala mɔɔ kɛmaa bɛ nzule kanrɛlɛ ko bɔbɔ wɔ Kelaese ati la ɔnrɛminli ye ahatualɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Na saa awie noko yɛ maa ngakula ngyikyi ɛhye mɔ bie mɔɔ die me di la minli bɛ diedi a, yemɔ saa bɛkyekyele ɔ kɛnra ɛdibolɛ bɛhɔdole ye nyevile kunlu bɔbɔ a anrɛɛ ɔle kpalɛ ɔmaa ye.<verse eid="MRK 9:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43-44" />“Ɛhye ati saa ɛnea na ɛ sa bɔbɔ a gyegye wɔ a ɛnee pɛ ye to ye lɔ. Ɔle kpalɛ kɛ ɛkɛva ɛsalɛ ko ɛkɛhɔ anwuma maanle ne anu tɛla kɛ ɛlɛ nwiɔ na bɛkɛvuandi wɔ bɛkɛdo Abɔnsam sendɔlɛra ne anu la! <verse eid="MRK 9:43-44" /><verse number="45-46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45-46" />Saa ɛ gyakɛ babonle ne a nee wɔ kɛhɔ munzule nu a, pɛ ye to ye lɔ! Ɔle kpalɛ kɛ ɛkɛva ɛ gyakɛ sinli ɛkɛhɔ ngoane mɔɔ ɔnlɛ awieleɛ la anu tɛla kɛ bɛkɛvuandi wɔ mumua ne bɛkɛdo Abɔnsam senle ne anu la.<verse eid="MRK 9:45-46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />“Yɛɛ saa ɛ nye noko a gyegye wɔ a, tu ye to ye lɔ. Ɔle kpalɛ kɛ ɛkɛva ɛnyelɛ ko ɛkɛhɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu tɛla kɛ ɛkɛva ɛnyelɛ nwiɔ ne ɛkɛnwu Abɔnsam senle ne, <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />ɛleka ne mɔɔ senle ngome a le bɛ ngyenle, <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />na senle ne ɛnnu ɛlɛ la.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />“Ngyenle mɔɔ ye menlemenle kɛwie la anwo ɛnlɛ nvasoɛ biala bieko; ɔluakɛ, ɔngola ɛhwee boɛ yɛ. Ɛhye ati mmamaa wɔ ngyenle ne menlemenle wie! Bɛ nee awie biala ɛdɛnla anzondwolɛ nu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse yeyele kpuyia dɔɔnwo anloa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Akee Gyisɛse vile Kapɛnayɛm na ɔhɔle Dwudiya nyiakɛ wɔ Dwudiya ɛweɛne ne azo mɔɔ ɔdi ɔkɔ Azule Dwɔdan sɛnzɛnduduleɛ afoa nu la. Na eza menli dɔɔnwo ne rale; na kɛmɔ dahuu ɔyɛ ye ala la, ɔhɔle zo ɔhilele bɛ debie.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Na Dwuuma Anwodelɛ Eku ne anzɛɛ Falasiima bie mɔ rabizale ye kɛ, “Ɛmaa ewuolebɔlɛ nwo adenle ɔ?” Nɔhalɛ, ɛnee bɛkpondɛ kɛ bɛsɔ ye bɛnea ala.<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Gyisɛse bizale bɛ kɛ, “Duzu edwɛkɛ a Mosisi hanle wɔ ewuolebɔlɛ nwo a?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Bɛbuale ye kɛ, “Mosisi zele kɛ bɛmaa nwolɛ adenle. Na emomu mɔɔ hyia mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ nrenyia ne yɛ la a le kɛ ɔkɛlɛ kɛlata ɔmaa ɔ ye ne kɛ yebɔ ye ewuole.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Gyisɛse bizale kɛ, “Na duzu ati a ɔhanle zɔhane a? Mebaha deɛ mɔɔ ɔti ɔhanle ɛhye la meahile bɛ, na yemɔ a le kɛ, ɔlua bɛ ahonle ɛsesebɛ nee bɛ atisesebɛ ne mɔ ati ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6-7" />Na tɛ ɛhye noko a le Nana Nyamenle adenle fɔɔnwo ne a. Ɔluakɛ, mɔlebɛbo ne ala yɛɛ ɔbɔle nrenyia nee raalɛ kɛ ɔwɔ kɛ bɛbɔ nu wɔ agyalɛ mɔɔ ɛngu ɛlɛ la anu a; ɛhye ati a nrenyia gyakyi ɔ ze nee ɔ nli, <verse eid="MRK 10:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />na ɔ nee ɔ ye bɛbɔ nu mɔɔ ɛnee bɛnle nwiɔ bieko, na bɛle nwonane ko ala la. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Yɛɛ dasanli biala noko ɛnlɛ adenle kɛ ɔkɛkpakye mɔɔ Nana Nyamenle ɔdaye yeha yebɔ nu la anu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Nzinlii, mɔɔ ɔ nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ angome hale sua nu la, bɛvale adwenle nzuzulɛ ɛhye bɛrale bieko.<verse eid="MRK 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Saa nrenyia bɔ ɔ ye ewuole na ɔkɔgya raalɛ fofolɛ a, ɛnee yedo agyalɛ mɛla yetia ye. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Yɛɛ saa raalɛ noko gyakyi ɔ hu kɔ agyalɛ fofolɛ a, ɔdaye noko ɔto agyalɛ mɛla ne zɔhane ala.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Kenle ko bie mrɛladane bie mɔ nee bɛ mra rale kɛ bɛmaa Gyisɛse ayila bɛ, na ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ voanle bɛ, na bɛzele bɛ kɛ bɛmmagyegye ye.<verse eid="MRK 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Na mɔɔ Gyisɛse nwunle mɔɔ ɛlɛsi la, yeangulo ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ nyɛleɛ zɔhane, ɔti ɔvale bɛ nwo ɛya na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛmaa ngakula ne mɔ ɛrɛla, ɔluakɛ, ɛhye mɔ zɛhae a Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne le bɛ deɛ a. Bɛmmafoa bɛ fee! <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Akee meka meahile bɛ anyebololɛ nu kɛ awie biala mɔɔ amba Nana Nyamenle ɛkɛ ne kɛ kakula ekyi la bɛnrɛmaa ye adenle wɔ Nyamenle belemgbunli maanle ne anu ɛkɛ ne ɛlɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Akee ɔvale ngakula ne mɔ ɔziele avinli na ɔvale ɔ sa ɔguale bɛ ti zo na ɔyilale bɛ.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Na mekɛ mɔɔ ɔsiezie ɔ nwo yeadu adenle bie la, nrenyia bie lɛ ɛnriandinlɛ rahotole ye zele kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ kpalɛ, duzu a ɔwɔ kɛ meyɛ na meanyia Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu meahɔ a?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Na Gyisɛse bizale ye kɛ, “Duzu ati a ɛfɛlɛ me kpalɛ a? Nana Nyamenle angomekye a le kpalɛ bɔkɔɔ a! <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Na wɔ kpuyia deɛ ne, yemɔ ɛdawɔ ɛze mɛla ne mɔ dɛba: Mmaku sonla; mmasɛkye agyalɛ; mmawua debie: mmadi daselɛ adalɛ; mmasisi awie; di ɛ ze nee ɛ nli eni”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Nrenyia ne buale Gyisɛse kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ, meli ɛhye mɔ amuala azo sumunli me ngakula nu; metɛfonle nyɛleɛ ɛhye mɔ anu ko bɔbɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Gyisɛse nleanle ye koonwu, na ɔhulole ye edwɛkɛ totohyia. Na akee ɔzele ye kɛ, “Emomu yeha wɔ debie ko ala; kɔ kɔdɔne mɔɔ ɛlɛ ye biala la amuala na fa ezukoa ne kyɛ ehyiavolɛma na ɛbanyia agyapadeɛ wɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu, na akee sia bɛla na bali me nzi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Akee nrenyia ne anyunlu hakyile, na ɔvale alɔbɔlɛ ɔhɔle, ɔluakɛ, ɛnee ɔle sukoavolɛ bedevinli kpalɛ.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Gyisɛse nwunle kɛ ɔlɛkɔ la ɔnleanle ye koonwu, na ɔzele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Ɔyɛ se kpalɛ kpalɛ ɔmaa sukoavolɛ biala kɛ ɔkɛhola Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu kɔ a!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Ɛhye zinle bɛ nwo totohyia. Ɔti Gyisɛse zile zo bieko kɛ, “Mediema alɔvolɛ, ɔyɛ se ɔmaa sukoavolɛma mɔɔ arɛle wɔ agyapadeɛ nu la kɛ bɛkɛhɔ Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu a. <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Ɔnyɛ se ɔmmaa afunlumu kɛ ɔkɛwolo aguyia tokule nu tɛla kɛ sukoavolɛ kɛhɔ Nyamenle belemgbunli maanle ne anu a.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anlie ɛhye anli! Na bɛbizale kɛ: “Saa tɛ sukoavolɛ a, ɛnee akee nwane bɔbɔ a bɛkola bɛdie ye ngoane wɔ ewiade anu a?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Gyisɛse nleanle bɛ koonwu, na akee ɔzele kɛ, “Ɛhye ɛnza Nana Nyamenle yɛ. Ɔluakɛ, debie biala ɛnye se ɛmmaa Nyamenle.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Pita zele kɛ, “Na yɛdayɛ noko mɔɔ yɛkpo debie biala na yɛra kɛ yɛbali ɛ nzi la, duzu a yɛbanyia ye a?”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Na Gyisɛse buale kɛ, “Mese bɛ nɔhalɛ nu kɛ awie biala ɛnle ɛke mɔɔ yekpo ninyɛne muala ɛlɛ a, aako aako, mediema mrenyia nee mraalɛ, ninli, selɛ, mralɛ, anzɛɛ agyapadeɛ, wɔ me ɛhulolɛ ti na yeha Edwɛkpa ne yehile awie mɔ, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />na ɔnrɛnyia ye mɔnwo ɛya ɛya ɔnrɛdɛla aako aako, mediema mrenyia, nee mraalɛ, ninli, mralɛ nee azɛlɛ, nee nwolɛ manzonlehwenlɛ a!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:30">“Ɛhye mɔ amuala bayɛ yɛ deɛ wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo, na wɔ ewiade ne mɔɔ bara la anu, ɔbanyia ngoane mɔɔ ɔnle awieleɛ a. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Na emomu menli dɔɔnwo mɔɔ kɛkala bɛdwenle kɛ bɛ nwo hyia somaa somaa la anwo ɛnrɛhyia bieko; yɛɛ dɔɔnwo noko mɔɔ ɛnlɛ anyunlunyia ɛnɛ la, banyia anyunlunyia wɔ ɛkɛ ne.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse ɛnwu ye ɛzie kɛ ɔbawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Na mɔɔ bɛzile nu kɛ bɛkɔ Gyɛlusalɛm la, Gyisɛse lumuale bɛ nyunlu; yɛɛ ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ noko lile ɔ nzi; na ɛzulolɛ hanle bɛ kpole. Ɔti Gyisɛse hwenle bɛ hɔle ahanle, na ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔka deɛ mɔɔ saa bɛdwu Gyɛlusalɛm a ɔbazi ɔ nwo zo la amuala yeahile bɛ.<verse eid="MRK 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Saa yɛdwu ɛkɛ ne a, bɛbahye Mame, Sonla Ra ne, na bɛ nee me ahɔ azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ nee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ ɛkɛ na bɛmɛ a bɛbabua me mgbɔvodɛne kɛ ɔwɔ kɛ mewu, na bɛaye me bɛamaa Wulomuma ne kɛ bɛhu me a. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Bɛbazi me amgbu, bɛatoto nyɛlɛ me nwo, na eza bɛabila me empele na akee bɛahu me; na ye kenle nsa ne azo, eza mebadwazo meara ngoane nu bieko.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Akee Gyemise nee Dwɔn, mɔɔ bɛ ze a le Zɛbɛdi la, rale ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne. Na bɛzele ye bɛtɛɛ kɛ, “Yɛmenle, yɛkpondɛ kɛ ɛyɛ ahunlunyele debie ekyii ɛmaa yɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Gyisɛse bizale bɛ kɛ, “Duzu debie ɔ?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Bɛzele ye kɛ, “Yɛkulo kɛ yɛtɛnla ɛ nwo ɛkɛ ne wɔ wɔ belemgbunli maanle ne anu, mɔɔ ko badɛnla ɛ sa fema zo, na ko noko adɛnla wɔ bɛne zo a!”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Na Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Bɛnze mɔɔ bɛlɛbiza la! Asoo bɛbahola bɛanlo bɔnyema kɔpo ne mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ meno nu la anu ɔ? Anzɛɛ nyane ɛzɔnenlɛ ne mɔɔ bɛbava bɛazɔne me la, bɛbahola ɔ nloa gyinla ɔ?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Bɛbuale ye kɛ, “Ɛhɛe, yɛbahola!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Na Gyisɛse zele kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ nu, bɛbahola bɛanlo bɔnyema kɔpo ne anu na eza bɛazɔne bɛ wɔ nyane adenle ne anu, <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />na emomu menlɛ tumi biala kɛ menwɔva bɛ menwɔzie arelemgbunli mbia mɔɔ tɛla me deɛ ne la azo. Bɛhyehyɛ gyinlabelɛ ɛhye mɔ amuala kosooti dɛbadɛba.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Mɔɔ ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔɔ ɛha la dele mɔɔ Gyemise nee Dwɔn ɛbiza la, bɛvale bɛ nwo ɛya totohyia. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Ɔti Gyisɛse vɛlɛle bɛ na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Kɛmɔ bɛdabɛ mumua ne bɛze ye dɛba la, ewiade anu arelemgbunli nee menli mgbole mgbole ne mɔ tɛnla bɛ ezuavolɛ akɔme zo boo dahuu; <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />na wɔ bɛ afoa nu ɛdeɛ, ngakyile wɔ nuhua. Bɛ nuhua biala mɔɔ kulo kɛ ɔyɛ kpole wɔ bɛ avinli la ɔwɔ kɛ yɛ bɛ sonvolɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Yɛɛ mɔɔ kpondɛ kpole kpalɛ ne ayɛ noko la ɔwɔ kɛ yɛ bɛ muala bɛ kanranli. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Ɔluakɛ, Mame, Ngoanedievolɛ ne bɔbɔ, menle ɛke kɛ bɛzonle me, na emomu mewɔ ɛke kɛ mesonle menli, na eza noko meava me ngoane meamaa wɔ menli dodo bɛ ɛtane ti.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Akee bɛdwule Gyɛleko. Na nzinlii mɔɔ bɛfi sua ne azo la, menli dɔɔnwo ne ala doale bɛ. Na ɔrale ye kɛ ɛnee nrenyia anyezinliravolɛ sɛlɛzɛlɛvolɛ bie mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Baatemeɛse, mɔɔ ɔ ze a le Temeɛse la, de adehanle ɛkɛ ne.<verse eid="MRK 10:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Na mɔɔ Baatemeɛse dele kɛ Gyisɛse mɔɔ vi Nazalɛte la ɛbikye ɛkɛ la, ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔteɛdea nu kɛ, “Gyisɛse, Devidi Ara, nwu me anwunvɔne!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Na menli ne bie mɔ deɛdeanle nu guale ɔ nwo zo kɛ, “Mua ɛ nloa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:48">Noko ɛnee bɔ zo mɔɔ ɔ nye ɛbolo kpalɛ a: “O Devidi Ara, nwu me anwunvɔne!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Na mɔɔ Gyisɛse dele ɔ ne la, ɔgyinlanle ɛkɛ ne wɔ adenle ne avinli na ɔzele kɛ, “Bɛze ye kɛ ɔrɛla ɛkɛ.” Ɔti akee bɛvɛlɛle nrenyia anyezinliravolɛ ne. Bɛzele ye kɛ, “Wɔmɔ mɔɔ ɛ ti ɛyɛ boɛ a, bɛla, ɔlɛfɛlɛ wɔ!” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Baatemeɛse kpale ye ɛdanlɛ dɛba ne ɔ nwo ɔguale ye ahanle, na ɔwulule kyela kyela ɔrale Gyisɛse anwo ɛkɛ ne. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Na Gyisɛse bizale ye kɛ, “Duzu a ɛkulo kɛ meyɛ memaa wɔ a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Na ɔbuale ye kɛ, “O, Kilehilevolɛ, mekpondɛ kɛ menwu debie!”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Na Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Wioo, kɔ wɔ ɛleka bie. Wɔ diedi ɛlie wɔ ngoane.” Na ɛkɛ ne ala nrenyia anyezinliravolɛ ne nwunle debie, na ɔdoale Gyisɛse wɔ adenle ne anu, na ɔ nee ye hɔle.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛrale Gyɛlusalɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Na mɔɔ bɛbikyele Bethphage nee Bɛtefagye mɔɔ wɔ Gyɛlusalɛm kandiba la, Gyisɛse zoanle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anu nwiɔ maanle bɛlumuale, na ɔ nee mɔɔ ɛha la hendɛle Boka Ɔlivi ne azo.<verse eid="MRK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Ɔzele nwiɔ ne kɛ, “Bɛhɔ namule ne mɔɔ wɔ lɔ la azo, na bɛbanwu ɛkpɔnwɔ ralɛ mɔɔ bɛhenda ye, na awie biala ɛtɛtɛnlanle zo ɛlɛ la. Bɛzanyi ye na bɛva ye bɛrɛla ɛke. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Na saa awie biala biza bɛ nwolɛ edwɛkɛ a, bɛze ye ala kɛ, ‘Yɛ menle ɛhyia ɔ nwo, na ɔnrɛhyɛ biala ɔ nee ye bazia ara.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4-5" />Ɛdoavolɛma nwiɔ ne mɔ hɔle la, amgba noko bɛnwunle ɛkpɔnwɔ ne mɔɔ bɛhenda ye la wɔ adenle ne anu wɔ sua bie anzi. Na mɔɔ bɛsanyi ye la, menli mɔɔ gyigyi ɛkɛ ne la bie mɔ bizale bɛ kɛ, “Na duzu a bɛlɛyɛ la? Duzu ati a bɛlɛsanyi ye a?”<verse eid="MRK 11:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Ɔti bɛhanle mɔɔ Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ bɛha la, na amgba noko bɛmaanle bɛ adenle.<verse eid="MRK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Ɔti bɛvale ɛkpɔnwɔ ralɛ ne bɛrɛlɛle Gyisɛse, na ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ vale bɛ ndɛladeɛ ne mɔ guale ɔ nwo zo maanle ɔdɛnlanle zolɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Na menli dɔɔnwo ne anu bie mɔ noko vale bɛ ndanlɛ sesɛle ɔ nyunlu ɛkɛ ne aze wɔ adenle ne anu, na bie mɔ noko vale mrɛlakɛ nee nya guale adenle ne anu maanle ye.<verse eid="MRK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Akee bɛdole ɛlɔnwɔne ɔ nyunlu nee ɔ nzi, yɛɛ ɔli bɛ avinli a, na bɛ muala bɛdeɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ, “Nyilalɛ ɛha Belemgbunli ne!” “Nyilalɛ ɛha mɔɔ ɔlua Awulae duma nu ɔlɛba la!” <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />“Nyilalɛ ɛha Nyamenle wɔ yɛ ze Devidi belemgbunli maanle ne ye ɛzialɛ nwo.” “Nyilalɛ ɛha anwuma anwuma Belemgbunli ne!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Gyisɛse dwule Gyɛlusalɛm na ɔhɔle Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu. Na ɔgyelele ɔ nye ɔnleanle debie biala mɔɔ wɔ ɛkɛ ne la kpalɛ na akee ɔvile ɛkɛ ɔhɔle-ɔluakɛ ɛnee maanle nu ɛlɛba aramua, ɔti ɔ nee ɛdoavolɛma bulu nee nwiɔ ne hɔle Bɛtani.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Nwonlomɔ ne mɔɔ bɛfi Bɛtani la, ɛnee ɛhɔne ɛlɛku ye. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Mɔɔ bɛhɔle ekyii la, ɔnwunle dɔma baka bie mɔɔ ɛwula nya fii a, ɔti ɔhɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔkakpondɛ ye ma ne bie yeali. Na yeannyia ɛhwee, ɔluakɛ, ɛnee ye ɛzolɛ mekɛ ne tɛbɔ amozi.<verse eid="MRK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Na Gyisɛse zele baka ne kɛ, “Ɛnrɛzo ma bieko ɛlɛ!” Na ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ noko dele kɛ ɔlɛka ɛhye.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Na mɔɔ bɛziale bɛhɔle Gyɛlusalɛm la, ɔhɔle Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu bieko na ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔfoa guadivolɛma ne mɔ nee bɛ ɛdɔvolɛma ne mɔ na ɔvuandinle bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛsenza ezukoa la ɛkponle ne mɔ ɔguale na eza ɔbubule bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛtɔne aabule nloma la kpɔda ne mɔ. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Na ɔzile menli mɔɔ lɛ ninyɛne adɔne ngakyile mɔɔ bɛ nee bɛ ɛlɛba nu la adenle.<verse eid="MRK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛhɛlɛ ye wɔ Ngɛlɛlera ne anu kɛ, ‘Me Asɔne Sua Kpole ne le nzɛlɛlɛleka maa ewiade amra amuala’, noko akee bɛmɛ bɛva bɛhakyi awulema tɛnlabelɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Na mɔɔ azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ nee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ dele deɛ mɔɔ yeyɛ la, bɛbɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛsuzu adenle kpalɛ mɔɔ bɛdua nu a ɛnee bɛkɛye ye bɛkɛvi ewiade a. Noko ɛnee bɛsulo kɛ begyebegyeyɛlɛ anzɛɛ nzaka kɛzi, ɔluakɛ, awie biala hulole Gyisɛse ngilehilɛ ne kpalɛ.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Ye nɔsolɛ ne, Gyisɛse nee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ vile sua ne azo kɛmɔ bɛta bɛyɛ la. <verse eid="MRK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Na nwonlomɔ ne mɔɔ ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ dwule ɛleka mɔɔ dɔma baka ne mɔɔ ɔwale ye amonle ne la gyi la, bɛnwunle kɛ yegyengye ɔvi ye ndinli ne abo too ɔkɔkpula ɔ ti zo. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Na Pita hakyele mɔɔ Gyisɛse hanle hilele baka ne wɔ kenle ne mɔɔ ɛpɛ nu ɛze la, na ɔdeanle nu kɛ, “Awulae, nea! Dɔma baka ne mɔɔ ɛwale ye amonle la ɛgyengye!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22-23" />Na Gyisɛse bua bɛ la, ɔzele ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Saa bɛlɛ diedi wɔ Nana Nyamenle anu a, nɔhalɛ tagyee ne ɛne, bɛbahola bɛaze Boka Ɔlivi ɛhye kɛ, ‘Tu twi wɔ ɛke na kɔgua Nyevile Tandane ne anu lɔ,’ na ɔbayɛ zɔ noko. Deɛ mɔɔ hyia ala la a le kɛ bɛkɛlie bɛkɛli na bɛnrɛzu nwolɛ kpolera! <verse eid="MRK 11:22-23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Bɛdie me! Saa bɛlɛ diedi a debie biala mɔɔ bɛkɛzɛlɛ la bɛ sa baha ye! <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Emomu, saa ɛyɛ asɔne a, dumua fa awie biala mɔɔ ɛ nee ye lɛ edwɛkɛ la ɛtane kyɛ ye, amaa ɛ Ze ne mɔɔ wɔ anwuma la noko ava wɔ ɛtane ɛdeɛ ne ahyɛ wɔ, ɔluakɛ, saa wɔanva ɛtane wɔangyɛ a, ɛ Ze ne mɔɔ wɔ anwuma la noko ɛnrɛva wɔ deɛ ne ɛnrɛhyɛ wɔ ɛlɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26-28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26-28" />Mekɛ ɛhye anu ɛnee akee bɛdwu Gyɛlusalɛm bieko, na mɔɔ ɔlua Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu la, azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ nee Dwuuma mgbanyima ne bie mɔ rabizale ye kɛ, “Duzu a ɛlɛkɔ zo wɔ ɛke a? Nwane a maanle wɔ tumi kɛ ɛvoa guadivolɛma ne mɔ a?”<verse eid="MRK 11:26-28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Mebabiza bɛ edwɛkɛ ko, na saa bɛbua me nwolɛ a, medame noko mebabua bɛ! <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Duzu a bɛka ye wɔ Dwɔn Sɔnevolɛ ne anwo a? Nana Nyamenle a zoanle ye, anzɛɛ? Anzɛɛ nwane a zoanle ye a? Bɛbua me!”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Bɛzuzule ɛhye anwo wɔ bɛ avinli dedee la ɛnee akee mɔɔ bɛka ye bɛ kominza abo la a le kɛ, “Saa yɛse kɛ, Nana Nyamenle a zoanle ye a, ɔbaze yɛ kɛ, ‘Wioo, na duzu ati a bɛanlie ye bɛanli a?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Emomu saa yɛse kɛ, tɛ Nana Nyamenle noko a zoanle ye a, ɛnee yɛnwu amaneɛ wɔ menli dɔɔnwo ɛhye asa anu.” Ɔluakɛ, menli ne amuala liele lile ɛsesebɛ ne ala kɛ Dwɔn le kapezonli.<verse eid="MRK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Ɔti bɛzele ye kɛ, “Yɛnrɛhola ɛhye bua. Yɛnze.” Na Gyisɛse noko buale bɛ kɛ, “Saa ye zɔ ɛdeɛ a ɛnee medame noko menrɛhola bɛ kpuyia deɛ ne anloa ye!”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Adawu adawu mɔɔ Gyisɛse bɔle la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Mrɛlɛbulɛ nwɔra ne mɔ mɔɔ Gyisɛse dole hilele menli ne mekɛ ne anu la bie mɔ ɛne: “Nrenyia bie yɛle ye nwanye tola bie na ɔliele nwolɛ bane, na ɔvunle kuma mɔɔ ɔbahwihwi bakama ne mɔ anu nzule yeagua nu la, na ɔzile esianwu ɔmaanle ɛya sinzavolɛ ne. Akee ɔhyɛle ɛya ne ɔmaanle ɛya abunsama na nzinlii ɔdule ɔvile ɛkɛ ne ɔhɔle maanle fofolɛ nu. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Mɔɔ ma ɛdelɛ mekɛ dwule zo la, ɔzoanle ye menli ne mɔ anu ko wɔ ɛya abunsama ne mɔ ɛkɛ kɛ ɔhɔlie ye afoa nu deɛ ɔrɛlɛ ye. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Na ɛya abunsama ne mɔ bolɛ nrenyia ne mɔɔ bɛzoanle ye la, na bɛmaanle ɔvale ɔ sa mgbane ɔziale ɔhɔle.<verse eid="MRK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />“Ɛya ne amenle ne zoanle sonla fofolɛ, na ɔdaye noko ɔnwunle anwubɛnyunlu zɔhane ko ne ala mɔɔ ɔdɛlale alumua ɛdeɛ ne bɔbɔ a, ɔluakɛ, bɛbole ye kpole kpalɛ too bɛbodale ɔ ti bɔbɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Sonla fofolɛ bieko mɔɔ ɔzoanle ye la ɔdaye noko bɛhunle ye kpatalakpa; yɛɛ nzinlii ɛdeɛ noko mɔɔ ɔzoanle bɛ la yemɔ saa bɛambo bɛ a, bɛhunle bɛdabɛ hɔkpulale <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />kɛ ɔhale sonla kokye ɔdaye mumua ne ɔ ra nrenyia kokye ne. Ɔzoanle ɔdaye noko, na ɔdwenlenle kɛ yemɔ bɛkɛva bɛ nidi muala bɛkɛmaa ye.<verse eid="MRK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />“Na mɔɔ ɛyazonlɛma ne mɔ nwunle ye kɛ ɔlɛba la, bɛzele kɛ ‘Koliagya ne a ɛlɛba la. Bɛmaa yɛhu ye, na akee ɛya ne ayɛ yɛ deɛ!’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Ɛhye ati bɛhyele ye bɛhunle ye na bɛvuandinle ye sonlabaka mumua ne bɛdole ye lɔ wɔ nwanye tola ne anzi.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />“Duzu a ɛdwenle kɛ saa nwanye tola ne amenle te wɔ ɛhye anwo a ɔkɛyɛ a? Ɔbara yearahu bɛ muala noko, na yeava nwanye tola ne yeawula menli fofolɛ asa anu. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Yemɔti bɛngakye kɛ bɛgenga ɛhye wɔ Ngɛlɛlera ne anu ɔ? ‘Bolɛ ne mɔɔ suasivolɛma ne mɔ kpole ye la yemɔ a rayɛle kodoka zo bolɛ, mɔɔ bɛye ye nu a ɔnyɛ boɛ a! <verse eid="MRK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Ɛhye le Awulae ngyehyɛleɛ mɔɔ yɛ azibɛnwo kɛ yɛkɛnwu ye yɛ nye zo a.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpɔvolɛ zɔle Gyisɛse nleanle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Dwuuma mgbanyima ne mɔ hulole kɛ bɛkɛhye ye ɛkɛ ne ala, kɛ yeva adawu ɛhye yeha bɛ edwɛkɛ a, ɔluakɛ bɛnwunle ye kofee kɛ bɛmɛ a ɔ nee bɛ a, kɛ bɛmɛ a bɛle ɛya abunsama atisesebɛvoma ne mɔɔ wɔ ye adawu ne anu la a. Na ɔlua ɛzulolɛ mɔɔ bɛnyianle ye kɛ menli ne mɔ barateta bɛ la ati, bɛzulole kɛ bɛkɛzɔ ye nu. Yemɔti bɛgyakyile ye ɛkɛ na bɛhɔle. <verse eid="MRK 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Na bɛzoanle Falasiima nee Hɛlɔdianema, mɔɔ bɛle Nyamenlezonlenlɛ nee maanlebulɛ nwo eku la, kɛ bɛhɔzɔ ye bɛnlea wɔ edwɛkɛbizalɛ nu, amaa bɛanyia debie bɛaha bɛatia ye wɔ ye ɛdendɛlɛ nu mɔɔ ɔlua zo a bɛ sa baha ye bɛahye ye a.<verse eid="MRK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Na menli ɛhye mɔ noko hɔle la bɛzele ye kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ, yɛze kɛ Wɔmɔ ɛka nɔhalɛ ne bɔkɔɔ! Ɛnva sonla ɛnyɛ ɛhwee, yɛɛ ɛnnea sonla nyunlu, na emomu Awulae Nyamenle nɔhalɛ adenle ne ala a ɛkilehile a. Ɛhye ati ka kile ye, ɔfa mɛla nu kɛ yɛkɛdua adwule yɛkɛmaa Wulumu Arane ne anzɛɛ?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Gyisɛse nwunle bɛ nzi na ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛva dwɛtɛ ne bie bɛmaa menea, na mebahile bɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Na mɔɔ bɛvale bɛmaanle ye la, ɔbizale bɛ kɛ, “Na nwane nvoninli nee amodinli a gua dwɛtɛ ye azo la?” Bɛbuale ye kɛ, “Belemgbunli Siza ɛdeɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Saa ye deɛ a, ɛnee bɛva bɛmaa ye. Yɛɛ debie biala mɔɔ le Nyamenle deɛ noko la ɔdaye bɛva bɛmaa Nyamenle!” Gyisɛse ye azibɛnwo edwɛkɛ ɛhye maanle bɛvonvoanle bɛ ti anwo zɛhae ala.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Akee Sadusiima bie noko mɔɔ ka kɛ ewudwazo biala ɛnle ɛkɛ ne la, noko rale ɔ nwo ɛkɛ rabizale ye kɛ:<verse eid="MRK 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Kilehilevolɛ, Mosisi maanle yɛ mɛla bie kɛ, saa sonla nrenyia wu na yeangyakyi mralɛ a, ɔwɔ kɛ ɔ diema nrenyia ne gya kunlavolɛ raalɛ ne na ɔ nee ye wo mralɛ wɔ ɔ diema ne duma nu. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20-22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20-22" />Yɛde ɛhye. Na mediema mrenyia nsuu bie wale ɛkɛ, mɔɔ nuhua kpanyinli ne gyale raalɛ, na ɔwule la yeangyakyi mralɛ a. Yemɔti mɔɔ tia ye nwiɔ ne la gyale kunlavolɛ raalɛ ne; na yeangyɛ biala ɔwule, ɔdaye noko yeangyakyi mralɛ. Mɔɔ tia ye nsa ne noko la ɔdaye zɔhane ala, hɔkpulale kɛ bɛ muala bɛwuwule, mɔɔ biala angyakyi mralɛ a. Ɛhye amuala anzi ye, raalɛ ne ɔdaye noko ɔwule.<verse eid="MRK 12:20-22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />“Mɔɔ yɛkpondɛ yɛadie la a le ɛhye: ɛnee saa ewudwazo mekɛ ne dwu a boni a raalɛ ɛhye bayɛ ɔ ye a, ɔluakɛ yeyɛ bɛ nuhua ko biala aye ɛlɛ?”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Gyisɛse buale kɛ, “Mɔɔ gyegye bɛ la a le kɛ bɛnze Ngɛlɛlera ne, yɛɛ eza noko bɛnze Nyamenle tumi ne. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Saa mediema nsuu ne mɔ nee raalɛ ne noko vi ewule nu dwazo a, bɛ nuhua biala ɛnrɛhɔ agyalɛ bieko, bɛbayɛ kɛ anwumabɔvolɛma ne la pɛ.<verse eid="MRK 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />“Na mɔɔ fale ewudwazo ne anwo ɛdeɛ, kɛ bɛkɛdwazo la bɛtɛkengale ye wɔ ‘Adendulɛ’ nwoma ne anu kɛ Nyamenle zile dendɛle hilele Mosisi wɔ kpɔkɛ ne mɔɔ ɛlɛyela la anu la ɔ? Nana Nyamenle zele Mosisi kɛ, ‘Mame a mele Ebileham Nyamenle ne a, eza Mame a mele Ayezeke Nyamenle ne a, yɛɛ Mame noko a mele Gyekɔbo Nyamenle ne a.’<verse eid="MRK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />“Ɛnee Awulae Nyamenle ɛlɛka ahile Mosisi kɛ menli ɛhye mɔ, mɔɔ bɛwu dɛbadɛba la tɛte ngoane nu, ɔluakɛ anrɛɛ ɔnrɛha kɛ, ɔnle mɔwuamra bɛ Nyamenle, na emomu ɔle anyewɔzo amra bɛ Nyamenle! Na mese bɛ kɛ, bɛvo kpole kpalɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Na kɛlɛhɛlɛvolɛma ne mɔ ko mɔɔ ɛnee gyi ɛkɛ ne bie na ɔlɛtie edwɛkɛ nzuzuleɛ ne bie la nwunle kɛ Gyisɛse ɛmaa bɛ nyelebɛnloa kpalɛ bɔkɔɔ. Ɔti ɔbizale ye kɛ, “Mɛla ne mɔ anu boni a hyia kpalɛ a?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Gyisɛse buale kɛ, “Ko ne mɔɔ se kɛ, ‘Tie, O Yizilayɛ! Yɛ Awulae Nyamenle ne a le Nyamenle kotokokye ne a. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Na ɔwɔ kɛ ɛfa wɔ ahonle ne amuala, ɔ nee wɔ ɛkɛla anzɛɛ sunsum nee wɔ adwenle nee wɔ anwosesebɛ ne mɔ amuala ɛkulo ye.’<verse eid="MRK 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />“Mɔɔ tia ye nwiɔ ne la a le ɛhye: ‘Ɔwɔ kɛ ɛkulo ɛ gɔnwo kɛ ɛdawɔ ɛ nwo.’ Mɛla biala ɛnle ɛkɛ mɔɔ ɔtɛla ɛhye mɔ a.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Na kɛlɛhɛlɛvolɛ ne noko zele ye kɛ, “Yɛmenle, wɔha nɔhalɛ ne bɔkɔɔ kɛ Nyamenle le kokye, na awie bieko ɛnle ɛkɛ, kɛ Ɔdaye ɔ ngomekye. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Yɛɛ meze noko kɛ ɔhyia ɔtɛla debie biala kɛ menwɔva me ahonle nee me ndelebɛbo nee me anwosesebɛ muala menwɔhulo Ye, na menwɔhulo awie biala noko kɛ medame me nwo, tɛla kɛ menwɔva azubɔndeɛ ngakyile muala menwɔhɔ azukponle ne mɔɔ wɔ Asɔne Sua ne anu la azo.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Mɔɔ Gyisɛse noko nwunle kɛ nrenyia ɛhye lɛ ndelebɛbo la, ɔzele ye kɛ, “Ɛ nee Nyamenle Belemgbunli maanle ne bɛ avinli ɛndwe fee zɛ.” Na ɔvi zɔhane melɛ ne, awie biala angola ye edwɛkɛ biza bieko.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Amozi ye mɔɔ Gyisɛse kilehile wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu la, ɔbizale bɛ edwɛkɛ ɛhye kɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:35">“Duzu ati a bɛ kɛlɛhɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ ka kɛ Ngoanedievolɛ ne ɔwɔ kɛ fi Belemgbunli Devidi abusua nu a? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Ɔluakɛ, Devidi mumua ne lua Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne anwo zo zele kɛ ‘Nyamenle zele me Awulae kɛ, tɛnla me sa fema zo ɛke, kɔkpula kɛ menwɔva wɔ kpɔvolɛma amuala menwɔyɛ ɛ gyakɛ abo ebia a.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Na saa Devidi mumua ne fɛlɛ ye Awulae a, ɛnee kɛ ɔsi mɔɔ akee ɔyɛ ɔ ra ɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Ngilenu ɛhye yɛle menli ɛwolaa ne fɛlɛko, ɔti akee bɛvale anyeliele bɛdiele ye kpalɛ.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Ninyɛne bieko noko mɔɔ ɔhilehilele bɛ mekɛ zɔhane anu la bie mɔ ɛne:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:38">“Bɛnlea bɛ nwo boɛ wɔ kɛlɛhɛlɛvolɛma ne mɔ anwo! Ɔluakɛ, dahuu bɛkulo kɛ bɛwula azukoavolɛ nee nwomavoma adeladeɛ mgbole mgbole, na eza bɛkpondɛ kɛ awie biala kɛhoto bɛ wɔ mekɛ biala mɔɔ bɛlua gua zo bɔbɔ la. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Bɛkulo kɛ bɛtɛnlɛdɛnla mbia mgbalɛ ne mɔ azo wɔ ayiasua ne mɔ anu, ɔ nee mgbanyinli tɛnlabelɛ wɔ ɛkponledolɛ bo, <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />noko akee ɔnyɛ bɛ nyiane bɔbɔ kɛ bɛsisi ahunlavolɛ mraalɛ wɔ bɛ aako aako nu, na bɛkpati bɛyɛ nzɛlɛlɛ ndendenle ndendenle wɔ bagua nu a. Na ɔlua deɛ ɛhye noko mɔɔ bɛyɛ la ati, bɛ ndeanlɛ ɛdeɛ ne bayɛ bedevinli kpalɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Akee ɔhɔle ɛleka mɔɔ nlɛka ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛfa bɛdielie ezukoa wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu la gyigyi la, na akee ɔdɛnlanle aze kɛ ɔnea menli ɛwolaa ne bɛ ezukoa mɔɔ bɛlɛfa bɛaragua nlɛka ne anu la. Azukoavolɛ mɔɔ wɔ nu la vale ezukoa mgbole mgbole guale nu. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Na kunlavolɛ raalɛ ehyianli bie ɔdaye noko ɔrale na ɔradole nu kapɛlɛ nwiɔ.<verse eid="MRK 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43-44" />Gyisɛse nleanle ɛhye koonwu na ɔvɛlɛle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ɔ nwo ɛkɛ ne na ɔzele kɛ, “Kunlavolɛ raalɛ ehyianli zɔhane ɛmaa ezukoa mɔɔ bo mɔɔ azukoavolɛ ne mɔ ɛmaa mɔɔ bɛva bɛbɔ nu la azo! Ɔluakɛ, bɛmɛ mɔɔ yebu bɛ nwo zo la anu ekyi bie a bɛmaanle a, wɔ melɛ mɔɔ raalɛ ne yemɔ ɔvale ɔ ti nee ɔ bo ne amuala ɔmaanle la.”<verse eid="MRK 12:43-44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Gyisɛse hanle mɔɔ bazi kenlebie la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Gyisɛse vi Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu zɔhane kenle ne ɔbahɔ la, ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ko zele kɛ, “Kilehilevolɛ, nea azua ngɛnlɛma ngɛnlɛma ɛhye mɔ! Nea kɛ bɛzi bɛva awole bɛyɛ bane ne mɔ anwo kɛnlɛma bie a.”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Gyisɛse buale bɛ kɛ, “Amgba, na emomu, bɛnlea! Bɛnrɛgyakyi bolɛ kokye bɔbɔ mɔɔ la ko anwo zo mɔɔ yemɔ bɛnrɛbu bɛnrɛgua ye aze a.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3-4" />Na mɔɔ ɔde Boka Ɔlivi ne agye nu mɔɔ di kɔne Gyɛlusalɛm azo ɛkɛ la, Pita, nee Gyemise nee Dwɔn, nee Andelu mɔ rale ɔ nwo ɛkɛ na bɛbizale ye kɛ, “Kenle zu pi yɛɛ ɛhye mɔ amuala bazi wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ɛhye anwo zo a? Na saa ɛhye mɔ amuala bayɛ ɛkɛ ɛdeɛ a, ɛnee nwolɛ sɛkɛleneɛ a le boni?”<verse eid="MRK 13:3-4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Ɛhye anwo, akee Gyisɛse hanle edwɛkɛ dɔɔnwo, ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛmmamaa awie biala bɛlɛbɛla bɛ, <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />ɔluakɛ, dɔɔnwo ne ala bara wɔ me duma nu araze kɛ, bɛmɛ a bɛle bɛ Ngoanedievolɛ ne a, na bɛbamaa menli dɔɔnwo ne ala avo adenle ne. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Na konle konle noko basisi ɛleka ɛleka moamoa nee yɛ bo anwo ɛke ala, noko akee ɛhye ɛngile kɛ awieleɛ mekɛ ne ɛdwu.<verse eid="MRK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />“Ɔluakɛ, maanle maanle baho atia bɛ nwo ngoko ngoko, na azɛlɛkpusulɛ dɔɔnwo bara wɔ ɛleka dɔɔnwo ne ala, na ɛhɔne noko ara. Na ɛhye mɔ amuala kile anwubɛnyunlu kpole ne mɔlebɛbo ne ala. <verse eid="MRK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Na saa ɛhye mɔ bɔ ɔ bo kɛ ɔsisi a, ɛnee bɛnlea bɛ nwo boɛ! Ɔluakɛ, bɛbahɔ amaneɛnwunle nu. Bɛbaye bɛ bɛ nee bɛ ahɔ mgbanyinli anyunlu wɔ bagua nu; na bɛabo bɛ wɔ ayialeka ne mɔ, na bɛagyinla amɛnladoma nee arelemgbunli anyunlu na bɛabua bɛ ndɛne wɔ mame me ti, na bɛava bɛali daselɛ kɛ bɛle me ɛdoavolɛma. Na ɛhye noko a le bɛ mekɛ kpalɛ ne mɔɔ ɔwɔ kɛ bɛka Edwɛkpa ne bɛkile bɛ a. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Na ɔwɔ kɛ bɛdumua bɛda Edwɛkpa ne noko ali bɛkile maanle maanle kosooti kolaa na awieleɛ mekɛ ne adwu. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Na saa bɛkye bɛ, na saa bɛkabua bɛ mgbɔvodɛne a, bɛmmamaa edwɛkɛ mɔɔ bɛbaha bɛalie bɛ nwo la yɛ bɛ adwenledwenle. Bɛha edwɛkɛ biala mɔɔ Nyamenle ɔdaye ɔkɛze bɛ ala la. Ɔluakɛ, tɛ bɛ a bɛbadendɛ a, na emomu, Sunsum Nwuanzanwuanza ne ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />“Mediema bayeye bɛ nwo ngoko ngoko amaa ewule; selɛma baye bɛ mra amaa, yɛɛ ngakula noko baye bɛ awovolɛma amaa kɛ bɛhu bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Na awie biala bakpɔ bɛ kɛmɔ bɛle me deɛ la ati. Na awie biala mɔɔ kɛgyinla kpundii kɛhɔ awieleɛ, mɔɔ ɔnrɛkpo me la, yemɔ a bɛbalie ye ngoane a.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“Na saa bɛnwu kɛ deɛ anwo ɛzulolɛ ɛzulolɛ ne gyi Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu, wɔ ɛleka mɔɔ ɔnle kɛ ɔgyinla la a, adiema kengavolɛ, te ɛhye abo kpalɛ o! tu, saa ɛkɛhola a, kɔ kɔvea Dwudiya awoka ne mɔ avinli. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15-16" />Nriandi kpalɛ! Saa ɛde abenlana bie anu wɔ wɔ sua ti zo bɔbɔ a, mmaka kɛ ɛdwu aze wɔahɔwolo wɔ sua ne anu, yɛɛ eza mmakɔfa debie biala wɔ sua ne anu noko. Eza saa ɛwɔ ɛya nu noko a, mmasia ɛ nzi bieko ɛbafa wɔ ezukoa anzɛɛ wɔ agyapandeɛ bɔbɔ.<verse eid="MRK 13:15-16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />“Nrenzɛvolɛma nee mrɛladane mɔɔ bɛlɛtete bɛ mra wɔ zɔhane mekɛ ne anu la, bɛ gyakɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Na bɛzɛlɛ ɛsesebɛ ɛsesebɛ ne ala kɛ, bɛ ɛnriandinlɛ ɛhye mmasi wɔ fɔsɛlɛ mekɛ nu. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Ɔluakɛ mɔɔ bazi la le nwanwanedeɛ mɔɔ sumunli kɛ bɛbɔle ewiade la bie ɛtɛsile ɛlɛ a, yɛɛ bie zɔhane noko ɛnrɛzi bieko. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Na saa Awulae ampɛ anwubɛnyunlu zɔhane azo sikalɛ ko a, yemɔ ɛkɛla biala ɛnle ɛkɛ ne mɔɔ yemɔ ɔbanyia ngoane wɔ azɛlɛ ye azo a. Noko ɔlua ye menli mɔɔ yekpa bɛ la ati ɔbapɛ zɔhane mekɛ ne azo sikalɛ.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />“Na mekɛ zɔhane anu, saa awie biala se bɛ kɛ, ‘Ngoanedievolɛ ne ɛne’ a, anzɛɛ kɛ, ‘Yemɔ a lua lɔ la,’ a, bɛduodua bɛ nzo, bɛmmadie bɛdi. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Ɔluakɛ, Ngoanedievolɛma adalɛ nee ngapezoma adalɛma dɔɔnwo ne ala badwazo mɔɔ bɛbayɛ nwanwane ninyɛne dɔɔnwo na bɛahile sɛkɛlɛndeɛ ɛzulolɛ ɛzulolɛ, mɔɔ saa wɔannea bɔbɔ a bɛbava bɛabɛlɛbɛla Awulae Nyamenle mumua ne Ɔ mra mɔɔ yekpa bɛ bɔbɔ la a. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Bɛnlea boɛ! Mebɔ bɛ kɔkɔ dɛbadɛba!<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Na wɔ anwubɛnyunlu ne anzi, akee sɛnzɛne ne bayɛ kusuu, na siane ne noko ɛnrɛda, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />na nwɔlɛra ne mɔ noko badudu agua aze na anwuma maanle ne amuala bawozo gyigyi gyigyi zɛhae ala.<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />“Akee aleɛabo amra amuala banwu Medame, Sonla Ra ne, kɛ mevi amungu kusuu ne anu melɛba wɔ tumi nee anyunlunyia kpole nu. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Na akee mebazoa anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔ amaa bɛahɔboɔboa me menli mɔɔ mekpa bɛ wɔ ewiade ɛleka biala la anloa.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Akee bɛva ɛzukoalɛdeɛ ɛhye bɛvi dɔma baka ne anwo. Saa ɔbɔ ɔ bo kɛ ɔbɔ ndotolo, na ɔwula nya a, ɛnee bɛze kɛ fɔsɛlɛ mekɛ ɛbikye ala ɛne. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Zɔhane ala noko yɛɛ saa mɔɔ meha la bɔ ɔ bo kɛ ɔsisi a, ɛnee bɛnwu ye wienyi na bɛlie bɛli kɛ me maleɛ ne ɛkpumgbu zo a, kɛ, ɛnee medwu wɔ anlenkɛ ne anloa bɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="MRK 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />“Nɔhalɛ, mese bɛ kɛ, ɛhye mɔ a le me maleɛ ne anzɛɛ ewiade ye awieleɛ ne anwo sɛkɛlɛndeɛ a. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Anwuma nee aze bapɛ nu aze ahɔ, na me edwɛkɛ ne ɛdeɛ, yemɔ bɛnrɛpɛ nu bɛnrɛze ɛlɛ, ɔwɔ ɛkɛ ne dahuu dahuu.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Na kenle kpɔkyee zɔhane anzɛɛ dɔnehwele holɛ ko ne mɔɔ ɛhye mɔ amuala bazi nuhua la ɛdeɛ, yemɔ awie biala, bɔbɔ Anwumabɔvolɛma ne mɔ mɔɔ wɔ anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu la, anzɛɛ mame bɔbɔ, biala ɛnze; Selɛ ne ala a ze a. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Na suzuamgba ala mɔɔ bɛnze mekɛ mɔɔ ɛhye mɔ amuala bazi la ati, bɛla bɛ nwo zo. Bɛmaa bɛ nye ɛla me ade, wɔ me maleɛ ne anwo.<verse eid="MRK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />“Me maleɛ ne le kɛ nrenyia bie mɔɔ dule adenle hɔle maanle gyɛne zo la. Ɔhyɛle ye ɛkpavolɛma gyima ne ɔmaanle bɛ kɛ bɛyɛ kolaa na yeahɔ, na eza noko ɔzele ye aako sinzavolɛ ne kɛ ɔmaa ɔ nye ɛla ye ade.<verse eid="MRK 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35-37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35-37" />“Ɛhye ati bɛgua bɛ nye aze kpalɛ! Ɔluakɛ, bɛnze kenle mɔɔ mebara a, saa wɔ nɔsolɛ nu o, saa nɔɔzo o, saa aleɛbahye o, anzɛɛ saa ewiazo o, bɛnze! Bɛmmamaa mebato bɛ kɛ bɛdeda o. Bɛzinza bɛhendɛ me maleɛ ne! Ɛhye a le me nrɛlaleɛ mɔɔ melɛfa meamaa bɛ nee awie biala a.”<verse eid="MRK 13:35-37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛye Gyisɛse bɛmaa na eza bɛhye Ye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Ɛnee yeha kenle nwiɔ na Akpabɛnwo Ɛvoyia ne, Dwuuma Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne wɔ ɛvolɛ ne anu mɔɔ bɛnli kpanwo mɔɔ bɛva mgbɔvonle bɛwula nu la adwu zo. Zɛhae mekɛ ye anu amuala, ɛnee azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ nee asɔne mgbanyima ne mɔ tɛkpondɛ adenle mɔɔ bɛfa zo a bɛ sa kɛha Gyisɛse bɛkɛhye ye fealera nu na bɛahu ye la.<verse eid="MRK 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Na bɛzele kɛ, “Yɛnrɛhola ɛhye yɛ wɔ Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia ne anu, ɔluakɛ, saa yɛannea ye boɛ a nzaka bara.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Mekɛ ɛhye anu, ɛnee Gyisɛse wɔ kokobɛvolɛ Saemɔn sua nu wɔ Bɛtani; na mɔɔ bɛdi bɛ nɔsolɛ aleɛ ne la, raalɛ bie rale ɛkɛ, mɔɔ ɔlɛ toba bie mɔɔ alufuanlɛ mɔɔ sonle bolɛ la wɔ nu a. Na ɔbɔle toba ne ati na ɔwolale anatele ne amuala ɔguale Gyisɛse ati zo.<verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4-5" />Na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛgua ɛkponle ne anwo bie la bie mɔ vale ɛya wɔ “deɛzɛkyelɛ” ɛhye anwo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:4-5">Na bɛzele kɛ, “Duzu ati a yezɛkye alufuanlɛ ɛhye a? Asoo ɔdɔnenle ye ɔliele ezukoa kpole yɛɛ ɔhyɛle ɔmaanle ehyiavolɛma a anrɛɛ ɔnyɛ boɛ ɔ?”<verse eid="MRK 14:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Na Gyisɛse zele kɛ, “Bɛgyakyi ye; duzu ati a bɛlɛtea ye wɔ debie kpalɛ mɔɔ yeyɛ la anwo a? <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Bɛmɛ dahuu bɛ nee ehyiavolɛma a de a, yɛɛ bɛhyia bɛ moalɛ nwo noko ɛsesebɛ ɛsesebɛ, ɔti bɛkola bɛboa bɛ mekɛ biala mɔɔ bɛkulo la; na mame mɔ bɛ nee me ɛnrɛdɛnla ɛnrɛhyɛ biala.<verse eid="MRK 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />“Yeyɛ mɔɔ ɔkɛhola ye yɛ ala la, na yelumua yekpokpa me sonlabaka ne na yeziezie ye yemaa ɛzielɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Na mese bɛ nɔhalɛ nu kɛ, aleɛabo ɛleka biala mɔɔ bɛbaha Edwɛkpa ne la, bɛbahakye mɔɔ raalɛ ɛhye ɛyɛ la noko na bɛaye ye nwolɛ ayɛlɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Na Dwudase Yesekaleɔto, mɔɔ ɔle ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anu ko la, hɔle azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ ɛkɛ na ɔ nee bɛ hyehyɛle kɛ ɔbaye Gyisɛse yeamaa bɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Na mɔɔ azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ dele deɛmɔti yera la, ɔyɛle bɛ fɛ totohyia ne ala, na bɛbɔle ye ɛwɔkɛ kɛ bɛbahyɛ ye debie mɔɔ sɔ ɛnyelɛ a. Ɔti ɔdaye noko ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔkpondɛ adenle biala mɔɔ ɔfa zo a ɔkɛhola ɔkɛye Gyisɛse ɔkɛmaa la.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Na kenle ne mɔɔ lumua wɔ Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia ne anyunlu mɔɔ bɛku mboane ne mɔ wɔ nu la dwule la, ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ bizale ye ɛleka mɔɔ ɔkulo kɛ ɔkɔdi Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia aleɛ ne la. <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Ɔti ɔzoanle bɛ nuhua nwiɔ wɔ Gyɛlusalɛm kɛ bɛhɔyɛ nwolɛ anwomoalɛ biala mɔɔ hyia la.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:13">Ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Mɔɔ bɛlua adenle nu bɛlɛkɔ ala la, bɛbanwu nrenyia bie mɔɔ ɔzo nzule buakɛ la kɛ ɔ nee bɛ ɛlɛyia. Bɛdoa ye. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Na aako ne mɔɔ ɔkɛlumua ɔkɛwolo nuhua la, bɛze aakomenle ne kɛ, ‘Yɛ menle ɛzoa yɛ kɛ yɛranlea ekpumgbunli ne mɔɔ wɔziezie nu wɔmaa yɛ mɔɔ nɔsolɛ yɛbarali Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia aleɛ ne wɔ nu la!’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Ɔ nee bɛ bavo esianwu bie azo yeahɔhile bɛ ekpumgbunli kpole bie mɔɔ bɛziezie nuhua bɔkɔɔ a. Ɛkɛ ne a bɛziezie yɛ aleɛ ne a.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Amgba noko ɛdoavolɛma nwiɔ ne mɔ lumuale hɔle sua ne azo, na bɛhɔnwunle debie biala kɛmɔ Gyisɛse hanle ala la pɛpɛpɛpɛ na bɛzieziele Akpabɛnwo aleɛ ne.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Ye nɔsolɛ nu, Gyisɛse nee ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛha la rale, <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />na mɔɔ bɛde ɛkponle ne anwo bɛdi aleɛ ne la, Gyisɛse zele kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ nu mese bɛ kɛ bɛ nuhua ko mɔɔ nee me ɛlɛto ɛsalɛ la baye me amaa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Ɛhye maanle alɔbɔlɛ hanle bɛ somaa ne ala, na bɛbɔle ɔ bo bɛbizebizale ye ngoko ngoko kɛ, “Awulae, ɛnee mame ɔ?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Ɔbuale bɛ kɛ, “Bɛdabɛ bulu nee nwiɔ ne anu ko mɔɔ ɔ nee me to ɛsalɛ ko wɔ ɛyɛba nu la ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Ɔwɔ kɛ mewu kɛmɔ ngapezoma ne mɔ hanle dole ɛkɛ ne dɛbadɛba la; na emomu mɔɔ ɔlua ɔ nwo zo a bɛbaye me bɛamaa la, munzule ɛha ye. Aa, saa bɛanwo ye bɔbɔ a anrɛɛ ɔle kpalɛ ɔmaa ye!”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Na mɔɔ bɛdi aleɛ ne la, Gyisɛse vale kpanwo na ɔzɛlɛle Awulae nyilalɛ ɔguale zolɛ, akee ɔbubule nu azinli azinli ɔhyɛle ɔmaanle bɛ na ɔzele kɛ, “Bɛlie bɛli, ɔluakɛ ɛhye a le me nwonane ne a.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Akee ɔvale nwanye kɔpo ko na ɔyɛle Awulae Nyamenle mo wɔ nwolɛ na akee ɔvale ɔmaanle bɛ; na bɛ muala bɛnlonle bie. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Akee ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Ɛhye a le me mogya ne mɔɔ bɛbahwi bɛagua wɔ menli dɔɔnwo ɛtane ti a la, na yemɔ yɛɛ bɛva bɛzɔ Awulae Nyamenle nee menli avinli ngyehyɛlɛ fofolɛ ne anloa a. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Na mese bɛ nɔhalɛ nu kɛ me nee bɛ ɛnrɛnlo nwanye ɛhye bieko kɔkpula kenle ne mɔɔ mebanlo ye fofolɛ wɔ Awulae belemgbunli maanle ne anu la.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Akee nzinlii, bɛdole ayɛlɛyelɛ edwɛne na bɛhɔle Boka Ɔlivi ne azo.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Na Gyisɛse zele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛ muala bɛbakpo me, ɔluakɛ, Awulae lua ngapezoma ne mɔ anwo zo ɛha kɛ, ‘Mebahu Boaneneavolɛ ne, na ɔlua zo mboane ne mɔ babɔ asande.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Na nzinlii saa mevi ewule nu medwazo meba ngoane nu bieko a, mebalumua bɛ nyunlu wɔ Galeli na meayia bɛ wɔ ɛkɛ ne.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Na Pita zele ye kɛ, “Saa ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛha la kɛkpo wɔ bɔbɔ a, me ngomekye ɛdeɛ, menrɛkpo wɔ ɛlɛ!”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Gyisɛse zele ye kɛ, “Pita, ɛbaza ɛ ne fane nsa wɔ me nwo kolaa na akɔlɛ abɔ fane nwiɔ wɔ ɛhyema aleɛbahye.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Na Pita zele ye kɛ, “Ɛhye angome ɛdeɛ, yemɔ Kyɛkyɛ! Saa ɔwɔ kɛ me nee wɔ wu bɔbɔ a menrɛkpo wɔ ɛlɛ!” Na zɔhane ala noko a bɛ muala bɛvuale bɛtafele zo a.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Akee bɛradole mbaka tola bie mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Gɛtesɛmani Tola la, na Gyisɛse zele ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ, “Bɛdɛnla ɛke bɛhendɛ me, na mekazɛlɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Ɔvale Pita, Gyemise, nee Dwɔn ɔbokale ɔ nwo, na akee ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔdi nyane nee alɔbɔlɛ kpole wɔ ye ahonle nu. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Akee ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Me ɛkɛla ɛlɛdi nyane ahɔ ewule nu bɔbɔ; bɛdenla ɛke bɛhendɛ na bɛ nee me ɛzinza.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Ɔhɔle ɔ nyunlu ekyii na ɔbutule aze na ɔzɛlɛle kɛ, saa ɔkɛyɛ boɛ a anrɛɛ amaneɛnwunlɛ dɔnehwele ne mɔɔ ɛlɛkendɛ ye la mmaba ɛlɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Na ɔzele kɛ, “Egya, Egya, debie biala ɛnza wɔ yɛ. Maa dwora kɔpo ɛhye ɛkpa me ti. Noko akee tɛ mɔɔ mame mekulo la ɔ, na emomu, wɔ ɛhulolɛdeɛ ɛdeɛ ne ɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Akee ɔziale ɔrale ɛdoavolɛma nsa ne mɔ anwo ɛkɛ ne bieko na ɔradole bɛ kɛ bɛdeda. Na ɔzele kɛ, “Saemɔn! Wɔla ɔ? Wɔangola ɛ nee me anzinza dɔnehwele ko bɔbɔ ɔ? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Bɛ nee me ɛzinza na bɛzɛlɛ na anrɛɛ yemɔ Abɔnsam bali bɛ nwo zo konim. Ɔboalekɛ, sunsum ne kulo, na nwonane ne a anwo ɛnyɛ se a.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Na eza ɔziale ɔhɔle bieko na ɔhɔzɛlɛle zɔhane ko ne ala. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Ɔziale ɔrale bɛ nwo ɛkɛ ne bieko na ɔradole bɛ kɛ bɛdeda, ɔluakɛ ɛnee akee bɛvɛ somaa. Yɛɛ bɛannwu edwɛkɛ bieko mɔɔ bɛka bɛahile ye bɔbɔ a.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Ɔrale mɔɔ tɔ, zo nsa ne la ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛhɔ zo bɛlafe; bɛlie bɛ menle! Kyɛkyɛ! Nafelɛ mekɛ ne ɛnyia ɛkpa nwolɛ. Bɛnlea! Bɛnyia bɛye me bɛwula atisesebɛvoma asa anu. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Bɛrɛla! Bɛdwazo! Ɔwɔ kɛ yɛkɔ! Bɛnlea! Mɔɔ baye me amaa la ɛdwu ɛke dɛbadɛba!”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Na ɛkɛ ne ala mɔɔ ɔ nloa wɔ zo ɔtɛtendɛ la, Dwudase, mɔɔ le ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ko, na yemɔ a baye ye amaa la nee menli dɔɔnwo mɔɔ bɛdu bɛfonyia mɔɔ Dwuuma asɔne mgbanyima nee azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyima ne mɔ ɛzoa bɛ, na bɛdedɛ ahoholombaka nee nrɛlande mɔ la rale.<verse eid="MRK 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Na Dwudase zele bɛ kɛ, “Ammaa bɛanvɛ na bɛanwu sonla mɔɔ bɛbahye ye la, saa mewolo menli ne mɔ anu na ahenle mɔɔ menwɔzoma ye la, ɛnee bɛze kɛ yemɔ ɛne.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Yemɔti mɔɔ bɛdwule ɛkɛ ne ala la pɛ, yɛɛ ɔhɔle Gyisɛse anwo ɛkɛ ne a. Ɔyɛle ye awawatuu na ɔzomanle ye kɛ asɛɛ ɛhulolɛ ngome ɛyi ye tɛkɛɛ la, na ɔzele kɛ, “Awulae!” <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Akee menli dɔɔnwo ne mɔɔ ɛdu ɛfonyia la hyele Gyisɛse na bɛzɔle ye nu kpundii kpalɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Akee Saemɔn Pita hwenle dadeɛ wɔ ye boa ne anu na ɔvale ɔpɛle Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli ne sonvolɛ ne anzo ko.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Gyisɛse bizale bɛ kɛ, “Duzu ati a bɛdedɛ ahoholombaka nee nrɛlande mɔ nee adu bɛra me nwo zo bɛbahye me kɛ asɛɛ mele kodiawu anzɛɛ awule bie a? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Duzu ati a bɛangye me wɔ Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu a? Ɛnee mewɔ ɛkɛ ne mekilehile bɛ debie dahuu ne ala. Na ɛhye mɔ amuala noko ɛlɛsisi amgba, amaa mɔɔ ngapezoma ne mɔ hanle mɔɔ fale me nwo la ali munli.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Mekɛ ɛhye anu, ɛnee akee ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ amuala ɛnriandi ye. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51-52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51-52" />Emomu, ɛnee kpavolɛ ko bie li bɛ nzi, mɔɔ ɛdanlɛ ala a bɔ ɔ kɔme nu a. Na mɔɔ menli ne mɔ yɛle kɛ bɛkye ye la, ɔguale ndwɛlɛ aze; ye ɛdanlɛ ne tetele kpasakpasa wɔ ɛhye ati. Ɔti ɔlɛ ɔ nwo zɔ a ɔnriandinle a.<verse eid="MRK 14:51-52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pita ɛkpo Gyisɛse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Akee bɛvale Gyisɛse bɛhɔle Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli ne sua nu, na yeangyɛ biala yɛɛ azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ nee Dwuuma mgbanyima mɔɔ ɛha la noko rayiale ɛkɛ ne a. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Pita lile bɛ nzi moamoa lɔ dedee na akee ɔvale bɛ sa abo nyaa ɔhɔzele ngoko wɔ senle mɔɔ sonvolɛma ne mɔ ɛlɛte la anwo.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Zɛhae mekɛ ye amuala, ɛnee azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ nee Dwuuma Kɔɔto Kpole kpalɛ ne ɛlɛkpondɛ daselɛ adalɛ bɛali bɛatia Gyisɛse mɔɔ bɛgyinla zo a ɛnee Gyisɛse kɛli fɔlɛ na ɔlua zo bɛ sa aha ye bɛabua ye ewule fɔlɛ, na bɛahu ye a. Noko bɛ ɛvɛlɛ muala yɛle ɛvɛlɛhunlu. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Alasevolɛ adalɛma dɔɔnwo ne ala yele bɛ nyunlu, noko akee bɛ nloa anzɛ bɛ nwo ɛlɛ, asolo awie biala daselɛlilɛ deɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Mɔɔ li amozi bɔkɔɔ la, mrenyia bie dwazole lile ɔ nwo daselɛ adalɛ zele kɛ, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Yedele kɛ ɔleka kɛ, ‘Mebabubu Asɔne Sua Kpole ɛhye mɔɔ menli vale bɛ sa zile la na meava kenle nsa meazi fofole mɔɔ beanva ɛsalɛ a bɛzile la!’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Na wɔ ɛhye anwo bɔbɔ, eza bɛ daselɛ ne mɔ mɔɔ bɛlile la anye ko!<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Akee Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli ne dwazole gyinlanle Kɔɔto ne anyunlu na ɔbizale Gyisɛse kɛ, “Ɛnrɛbua mɔɔ bɛlɛka bɛatia wɔ la anwo bie ɔ? Duzu a ɛlɛ ye ɛka wɔalie ɛdawɔ mumua nee nwo a?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Na ɛhye, Gyisɛse ambua nwole bie.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:61">Akee Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli ne bizale ye kɛ, “Wɔmɔ a le Ngoanedievolɛ ne, Nyamenle Ra ne anzɛɛ?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Gyisɛse buale kɛ, “Medame ɔ, na bɛbanwu Mame, Sonla Ra ne kɛ, mede Nana Nyamenle asa fema ne azo na mevi anwuma amungu ne anu melesia meara azɛlɛ ye azo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63-64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63-64" />Na akee Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli ne vale ɛya ngome tetele ye tɛladeɛ ne anu na ɔzele kɛ, “Duzu bieko a yɛkpondɛ a? Duzu ati a yɛkɛhendɛ alasevolɛ bieko a? Bɛdabɛ bɛde ye munzudwɛkɛ ne. Duzu adwenlenzuzule a bɛlɛ ye wɔ nwo a?” Bɛ muala bɛbuale ye fɔlɛ kɛ ɔwɔ kɛ ɔwu.<verse eid="MRK 14:63-64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Akee bie mɔ bɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛtoto nyɛlɛ ɔ nwo; bɛkyekyele ɔ nye ne mɔ na bɛbɔle ɔ bo kɛ bɛbobɔ ye abotokuma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:65">Mɔɔ bɛbobɔ ye abotokuma ne la, bɛzele kɛ, “Wɔmɔ kapezonli, nwane a bɔle wɔ mekɛ zɔhane anu a?” Sogyama ne mɔ mɔɔ ɛnee bɛ nee ye ɛlɛkɔ la bɛdabɛ bɔbɔ bɛbobɔle ye abotokuma ne bie maanle ɔyɛle alɔbɔlɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66-67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66-67" />Mekɛ ɛhye anu, ɛnee Pita wɔ kɔɔto ne anzi nehane alie nwo ɛkɛ. Na mbɛlɛra ne mɔ mɔɔ sonle Sɛlɛvolɛ Kpanyinli ne la anu ko nwunle Pita kɛ ɔlɛte senle ne bie.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:66-67">Ɔnleanle Pita koonwu na akee ɔzele ye kɛ, “Ɛdawɔ noko ɛle Gyisɛse, Nazalɛtenli ne ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ anu ko.”<verse eid="MRK 14:66-67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Pita zale ɔ ne, na ɔzele kɛ, “Mɔɔ ɛlɛka la, menze nwolɛ bie hweledede!” Ɔhanle ɛhye na akee ɔhwenle ɔ nwo ekyii ɔhɔle kɔɔto sua ne anu ahanle.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:68">Na ɛkɛ ne ala yɛɛ akɔlɛ bɔle a.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Bɛlɛra ne nwunle ye na ɔbɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔka yeahile menli mɔɔ gyigyi ɛkɛ ne la kɛ, “Yemɔ a gyi ɛkɛ ne la! Gyisɛse ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ ko ɛne!”<verse eid="MRK 14:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Pita zale ɔ ne bieko.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Na mɔɔ ɔhyɛle ekyii la, akee menli mɔɔ gyigyi senle ne anwo la bɛdabɛ bɛzele Pita kɛ, “Ɛdawɔ noko ɛle menli ɛhye mɔ bɛ nuhua ko, ɔluakɛ ɛle Galelinli, yɛɛ wɔ ɛdendɛlɛ noko kile!”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Akee Pita bɔle ɔ bo kɛ ɔwa amonle na eza ɔka ndane kɛ, “Menze sonla ɛhye bɔbɔ mɔɔ bɛlɛka ɔ nwo edwɛkɛ la fee zɛ!”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Na ɛkɛ ne ala yɛɛ akɔlɛ bɔle mɔɔ tia ye fane nwiɔ la a. Akee Pita hakyele edwɛkɛ ne mɔɔ Gyisɛse hanle hilele ye kɛ: “Kolaa na akɔlɛ abɔ fane nwiɔ la, ɛnee wɔkpo me fane nsa la.” Pita dwenlenle ɛhye anwo ala la akee ɔzunle kpole kpalɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ndɛnebualɛ nee ye ɛhunlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Nwonlomɔ mangyee ne ala, azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ, nee Dwuuma asɔne nu mgbanyinli, nee bɛ Nyamezonlenlɛ ahilehilevolɛ, Kɔɔto Kpole anzɛɛ Mɛla Eku ne amuala yiale nu kɛ bɛsuzu deɛ mɔɔ bɛkɛyɛ ye bieko la. Bɛ adwenlenzuzulɛ ne zile kɛ ɔwɔ kɛ bɛmaa azogya mɔɔ konlendeɛ wɔ bɛ nwo la fa Gyisɛse kɔmaa Paelɛte, mɔɔ gyi Wulomu Arane ne agyakɛ anu la.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Paelɛte bizale ye kɛ, “Ɛnee wɔmɔ a ɛle Dwuuma ne bɛ belemgbunli ne la ɔ?” Gyisɛse buale ye kɛ, “Ɛhɛe, ɛdawɔ wɔha.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3-4" />Akee azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ hanle ninyɛmunli dɔɔnwo mɔɔ yeyɛ la hilele ye, na Paelɛte bizale ye kɛ, “Duzu ati a ɛmbua bie a? Asoo ɛnlɛ ɛhwee ɛnga wɔ mɔɔ bɛha bɛtia wɔ la biala anwo ɔ?”<verse eid="MRK 15:3-4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Noko akee Gyisɛse andɛ ɔ nloa anu bɔbɔ bieko, na ɛhye noko yɛle Paelɛte azibɛnwo totohyia.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Na ɔle Dwuuma ne mɔ amaamuo kɛ saa Akpabɛnwo ɛvoyia ne dwu zo biala a, ɔwɔ kɛ Paelɛte ye Dwuuma mɔɔ bɛgua bɛ efiade la anu ko bɛmaa ɔkɔ ye sua nu, efiadedavolɛma ne mɔ anu ko biala mɔɔ menli ne kɛze kɛ bɛye ye la. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Zɛhae mekɛ ye noko, ɛnee Dwuunli ko mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Balabase, mɔɔ bɛbua ye nee ɔ gɔnwo mɔ bie mɔɔ bɛhunle menli wɔ basabasayɛlɛ mekɛ bie anu la fɔlɛ la, noko la efiade ne bie.<verse eid="MRK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Na ɔrale ye kɛ menli dɔɔnwo bie hɔle Paelɛte anwo zo hɔzɛlɛle ye kɛ ɔye efiadedavolɛma ne mɔ anu ko ɔmaa bɛ kɛmɔ ɔyɛ ye ala la.<verse eid="MRK 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Na Paelɛte bizale bɛ kɛ, “Ɛnee menye ‘Dwuuma Belemgbunli’ ne memaa bɛ ɔ? Yemɔ a le nuhua ne mɔɔ bɛkulo kɛ meye ye la ɔ?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Ɔluakɛ, ɛnee akee ɔdaye mumua ne yenwu kɛ ɔlua ɛkpɔlɛ gyɛne ti ala a azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ ɛye Gyisɛse ɛmaa a.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Mekɛ ɛhye anu, azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ wulale menli dɔɔnwo ne anyebolo kɛ bɛbiza bɛmaa bɛye Balabase, na emomu, tɛ Gyisɛse ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Paelɛte bizale bɛ kɛ, “Na saa meye Balabase a, ɛnee akee kɛ menyɛ nrenyia ɛhye mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye bɛ belemgbunli la ɛ?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Bɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ, “Bɔ ye meanubaka nu!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Paelɛte bizale bɛ kɛ, “Na duzu ati ɔ? Duzu ɛtane a yeyɛ a?” Noko ɛnee bɔ zo mɔɔ bɛlɛtea nu kpole kpalɛ a: “Bɔ ye meanubaka nu!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Akee kɛmɔ Paelɛte noko sulo kɛ begyebegyeyɛlɛ kɛra, na ɔhulole kɛ ɔkɛmaa menli ne arɛle kɛdɔ bɛ azule nu la ati, ɔyele Balabase ɔmaanle bɛ. Na ɔmaanle bɛbilale Gyisɛse empele, na ɔyele ye ɔmaanle bɛ kɛ bɛhɔbɔ ye meanubaka nu.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16-17" />Na akee Wulomu azogya ne mɔ vale ye hɔle Arane ne anu, na bɛvɛlɛle Arane ne anu sinzavolɛma ne mɔ amuala maanle bɛrayiale, na bɛwulale Gyisɛse tɛladeɛ kɔbenle, na bɛnwonle mbowule abotile bɛkpolole ɔ ti. <verse eid="MRK 15:16-17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Akee bɛzomanle ye, bɛdeɛdeanle nu bɛzele kɛ, “Akoaba! Dwuuma Belemgbunli!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Na bɛvale empele bɛbilale ye na bɛtotole ɔ nwo nyɛlɛ na akee bɛhotole ye kɛ “bɛyeyɛ” ye.<verse eid="MRK 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Mɔɔ akee bɛdabɛ bɛvɛle na bɛ kunlu dwole bɛ nwo la, bɛyele tɛladeɛ kɔbenle ne na bɛvale ɔdaye mumua ne ye deɛ ne bɛwulale ye bieko, na bɛ nee ye hɔle kɛ bɛkabɔ ye meanubaka nu.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Na bɛhyele Saemɔn mɔɔ vi Saelini, mɔɔ ɛnee ɔvi namule nu ɔlɛba, na ɔ nee bɛ yiale la kɛ ɔboa Gyisɛse wɔ ye meanubaka ne ɛzoalɛ nu. Saemɔn ɛhye ɔ mra a le Alɛzɛnda nee Lufɛse.<verse eid="MRK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Na bɛ nee Gyisɛse hɔle ɛleka bie mɔɔ bɛfɛlɛ ye Gɔlogɔta, mɔɔ ɔ bo kile kɛ, Etile kanrɛlɛ la. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Na bɛvale nwanye mɔɔ bɛva bɔnyema bɛfonla nu la bɛmaanle ye kɛ ɔnlo, noko akee ɔkpole. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Na akee bɛbɔle ye meanubaka nu, na bɛhwenle ye tɛladeɛ ne anwo adunyi kɛ saa ɔkɛyɛ nwane deɛ a.<verse eid="MRK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Bɛbɔle kɛyɛ nwonlomɔ dɔne ngɔnla la yɛɛ bɛbɔle ye meanubaka nu a.<verse eid="MRK 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Na bɛhɛlɛle deɛ mɔɔ ɔti bɛhunle ye la bɛguale ɔ ti sɔlɔ ɛkɛ ne wɔ taboa sinli bie azo. Deɛ mɔɔ bɛhɛlɛle la se, “Dwuuma ne bɛ Belemgbunli.”<verse eid="MRK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Zɔhane nwonlomɔ ne bɛbɔle awulema nwiɔ bie noko meanumbaka nu, bɛ meanumbaka ne mɔ wɔ ye ɛdeɛ ne foa nee foa yɛɛ yemɔ ɔwɔ bɛ avinli a. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Ɔti ɛhye maanle Ngɛlɛlera ne mɔɔ se, “Bɛdianle ye bɛbokale ɛtanevolɛma anwo” la penle zolɛ.<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29-30" />Menli mɔɔ ɛlɛpɛ nu ɛkɛ ne la zile ye amgbu, na bɛhɔsɔhɔsɔle bɛ ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:29-30">Bɛzele kɛ, “Wio! Se wɔmɔ ɛne! Nɔhalɛ, ɛkola ɛbubu Asɔne Sua Kpole ne ɛgua na ɛsi ye kenle nsa pɛ! Saa ɛ nwo yɛ ɛzulolɛ zɛhae ɛdeɛ a, ɛnee die ɛ nwo, na fi meanubaka ɛhye azo dwu aze.”<verse eid="MRK 15:29-30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Azɛlɛvolɛ mgbanyinli ne mɔ nee asɔne mgbanyima mɔɔ gyigyi ɛkɛ ne la noko zile ye amgbu ne bie zele kɛ, “Awie mɔ ɛlielɛ a ɔ nwo yɛ nwolɛ ndɛ a, na ɔngola ɔnlie ɔdaye mumua ne ɔ nwo!”<verse eid="MRK 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />“Ei, Ngoanedievolɛ ne ɛne!” Menli ne mɔ wudole ye, na bɛzele ye zɛ. “Saa wɔmɔ yɛɛ ɛle Yizilayɛma Belemgbunli ne a ɛnee ɛvi meanubaka ne azo dwu aze na yɛbalie wɔ yɛali!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Na nwulema nwiɔ ne bɔbɔ mɔɔ bɛdabɛ be nee ye dewu la noko zile ye amgbu.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Na ewia henlema ne, awozinli kabii rahedale aleɛabo amuala dedee bɛbɔle ewiazo dɔne nsa.<verse eid="MRK 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Na akee Gyisɛse vale ɛnelɛ kpole bie deanle nu zele kɛ, “Eli, Eli, lɛma sabaketani?” Ɔ bo a le kɛ: “Me Nyamenle, me Nyamenle, duzu ati a wɔkpo me a?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Menli mɔɔ gyigyi ɛkɛ ne la bie mɔ dwenlenle kɛ ɔlɛfɛlɛ kapezonli Yilaegya. <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Ɔti nrenyia ko bie nriandinle hɔvale emiane bɔle nwanye ɛnwonle bie anu na ɔdendenle ye anwuma wɔ baka ti ɔmaanle ye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:36">Akee nrenyia ne zele kɛ, “Bɛmaa yɛnlea kɛ saa Yilaegya kɛralie ye ɔkɛdwula ye aze amgba a!”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Akee Gyisɛse eza deanle nu kpole bieko, na akee ɔwule.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Na Asɔne Sua Kpole ne anu ɛdanlɛ ne suanle keledede vi ɔ ti zo radwule ɔ bo.<verse eid="MRK 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Na mɔɔ Wulomu sogya kpanyinli ne mɔɔ gyi ye meanubaka ne anwo la nwunle kɛ ɔzile mɔɔ ɔwule la, ɔdeanle nu ɔzele kɛ, “Nɔhalɛ, ɛhye a le Nyamenle Ra ne a!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Ɛnee mraalɛ bie noko gyi moa ɛlɛnea ye, na bɛmɛ a le Male mɔɔ vi Magedala la, Male (mɔɔ ɔ mra a le Gyemise Ekyi nee Dwose la), yɛɛ akee Salome nee mɔɔ ɛha la. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Bɛmɛ nee Galeli mraalɛ dɔɔnwo mɔɔ doale ye na bɛzonlenle ye wɔ Galeli, na bɛlile ɔ nzi bɛ nee ye rale Gyɛlusalɛm la.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42-43" />Ɛhye mɔ amuala zile wɔ kenle ne mɔɔ li Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne anzi la. Amozi ekyii wɔ kenle ko ne ewia ne Dwosefi mɔɔ ɔvi Arelematia, na ɔlɛ dibilɛ kpole wɔ Dwuuma Kɔɔto Kpole ne anzɛɛ Mɛla Eku ne anu na eza noko ɔ nye la Nana Nyamenle Belemgbunli maanle ne adenle la, zile ɔ kɛnra hɔle Paelɛte ɛkɛ hɔzɛlɛle Gyisɛse funli ne.<verse eid="MRK 15:42-43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Ɛnee Paelɛte ɛnlie ɛnli kɛ Gyisɛse amgba ɛwu dɛbadɛba, ɔti ɔvɛlɛle Wulomu sogyanli kpanyinli ne mɔɔ nea ɛkɛ ne la na ɔbizale ye. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Sogyanli kpanyinli ɛhye zile ye pi kɛ amgba yewu, ɔti Paelɛte zele Dwosefi kɛ akee ɔhɔva ye funli ne.<verse eid="MRK 15:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Dwosefi dɔle kisane bie, na ɔyele Gyisɛse ɔvile meanubaka ne azo, na ɔvale ɔkyekyele ɔ nwo na ɔziele ye wɔ bolɛ mɔɔ bɛze ye nla la anu, na ɔhundole bolɛ ɔnyinle anlenkɛ ne anloa.<verse eid="MRK 15:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Na Male mɔɔ vi Magedala la, nee Male, Gyisɛse ɔ nli, noko wɔ ɛkɛ ne ɛlɛnea melɛ mɔɔ bɛdole Gyisɛse nla nu la.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yedwazo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Aleɛ hyenle bieko na ye nɔsolɛ nu, mɔɔ ɛnee akee Ɛnwomenlelielɛ Kenle ne ɛpɛ nu la, Male mɔɔ vi Magedala nee Salome nee Male, Gyemise ɔ nli ne, hɔtotɔle funli ɛziezielɛ nwo ninyɛne mɔɔ le kɛ alufuanlɛ mɔ la.<verse eid="MRK 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Na aleɛbahye ne ala, mɔɔ ɛnee sɛnzɛne ne ɛtɛtudule bɔbɔ la, bɛvale bɛhɔle sɛka ne azo. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Na bɛlua adenle nu bɛkɔ la, ɛnee bɛlɛdwenle kɛ bɛkɛzi bɛkɛyɛ na bɛahundo bolɛ totohyia ne bɛavi sɛka ne anloa la.<verse eid="MRK 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Mɔɔ akee bɛdwule ɛkɛ ne la, bɛnleanle anwuma na bɛnwunle kɛ bɛye bolɛ ne mɔɔ ɛnee yɛ ɛnlomboɛ kpole kpalɛ la dɛbadɛba, na ɔ nyunlu adenle ne la ɛkɛ ne wienyi! <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Ɔti bɛhɔle sɛka ne anu na bɛnwunle kɛ kpavolɛ bie mɔɔ wula tɛladeɛ fufule nwohyee la de fema zo ɛkɛ ne. Ɛzulolɛ hanle mraalɛ ne mɔ totohyia, <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />na anwumabɔvolɛ ne zele bɛ kɛ, “Bɛmmamaa ɔyɛ bɛ azibɛnwo. Tɛ Gyisɛse, Nazalɛtenli ne mɔɔ bɛbɔle ye meanubaka nu la a bɛkpondɛ ye la ɔ? Ɔnle ɛke! Yedwazo yera ngoane nu bieko! Bɛnlea, ɛke a bɛziele ye a, na ɛleka mɔɔ ɛnee ɔla la ɛne. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Ɛhye ati akee bɛhɔ na bɛhɔze ye ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ mɔɔ Pita boka nwo la, kɛ Gyisɛse ɛlɛdumua bɛ nyunlu wɔ Galeli. Bɛbanwu ye wɔ ɛkɛ ne, kɛmɔ ɔhanle ɔhilele bɛ kolaa na yeawu la!”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Mraalɛ ne mɔ vi sɛka ne anu nriandinle, na anwowozolɛ nee ɛzulolɛ totohyia hanle bɛ, mɔɔ bɛangola tendɛ a.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Molɛ aleɛbahye a Gyisɛse vi ewule nu dwazole a, yɛɛ sonla mɔɔ lumuale nwunle ye noko la a le Male Magedala raalɛ ne mɔɔ ɔdule awozonle nsuu ne ɔvile ye nu la. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10-11" />Ɔhɔdole ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ kɛ alɔbɔlɛ ɛbubu bɛ bɔkɔɔ zɛ, na monle ɛbia bɛ takaa na ɔzele bɛ kɛ yenwu Gyisɛse, kɛ ɔde ngoane nu! Noko akee bɛanlie ye bɛanli.<verse eid="MRK 16:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Ɛhye mɔ anzi wɔ kenle ko zɔhane ala, Gyisɛse yele ɔ nwo hilele menli nwiɔ bie mɔɔ ɛnee vi Gyɛlusalɛm lua aze ɛlɛkɔ namule bie azo la, na kɛmɔ ɛnee yehakyi ɔ nwo la ati, bɛannwu ye sonla holɛ. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Nzinlii mɔɔ bɛnwunle ye sonla holɛ ko la, bɛvale ɛnriandinle bɛziale bɛhɔle Gyɛlusalɛm bɛhɔbɔle menli mɔɔ ɛha la noko amaneɛ, noko akee awie ko biala bɔbɔ anlie bɛ anli.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Nzinlii, eza ɔyele ɔ nwo ɔhilele ɛdoavolɛma bulu nee ko ne wɔ melɛ mɔɔ ɛnee bɛde aleɛ nwo la. Ɔhwile bɛ nyunlu wɔ bɛ kpolerazulɛ nee diedi mɔɔ bɛnlɛ ye la anwo bɔbɔ kɛ bɛanlie menli mɔɔ bɛnwu ye kɛ yedwazo yevi ewule nu la bɛanli la.<verse eid="MRK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Na akee ɔzele bɛ kɛ, “Ɔwɔ kɛ bɛkɔ aleɛabo kosooti na bɛkɔka Edwɛkpa ne bɛkile awie biala wɔ ɛleka biala. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkɛlie bɛkɛli na bɛkɛzɔne bɛ la, bɛbalie bɛ ngoane. Na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛkɛkpo kɛ bɛkɛlie bɛkɛli la, bɛbabua bɛ fɔlɛ.<verse eid="MRK 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />“Na bɛdabɛ mɔɔ bɛbalie bɛali la, bava me tumi adudu awozonle, na eza bɛadendɛ wɔ aneɛ aneɛ ngakyile nu. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Bɛbahola bɛazɔ nwɔlɛ nu bɔbɔ mɔɔ bɛngola bɛ ka a, yɛɛ saa bɛno debie biala mɔɔ ayidane wɔ nu bɔbɔ la a, ɔnrɛyɛ bɛ ɛhwee; na eza noko bɛbahola bɛava bɛ sa bɛagua wuliravolɛma anwo zo amaa bɛade kpɔkɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Mɔɔ Awulae Gyisɛse wiele tendɛ kile bɛ la, bɛvale ye bɛhɔle Anwuma belemgbunli maanle ne anu, na ɔhɔdɛnlanle Nana Nyamenle asa fema zo.<verse eid="MRK 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Na ɛdoavolɛma ne mɔ hɔle ɛleka biala hɔhanle Edwɛkpa ne, na Awulae noko nee bɛ yɛle gyima ne, na ɔzile bɛ edwɛkɛ ne pi wɔ nwanwane gyima mɔɔ vindele bɛ edwɛkɛ ne anzi wɔ ye tumi nu la.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>